<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Lente Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">FORHTHLAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Forhthlah pawl ih Ṭuanṭuannak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Forhthlah</para>
  <para style="toc3">Forh</para>
  <para style="mt1">FORHTHLAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Forhthlah pawl ih Ṭuanṭuannak</para>
  <para style="imt">Thuhmaṭhi</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Forhthlah pawl ih Ṭuanṭuannak</char> cabu cu Kawhhran hramthawhnak thuanthu a i ih Jesuh nih vancung a hang kai hlanah a dungthluntu pawl a sip hnei cia mangin, Jerusalem khua in Judea ram le hmun dang tiangah zangtih mangin kawhhran a karhzai tihmi ngankhumnak cabu a i (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>). Forhthlah cabu hi Luka Thuthang Ṭha ngantu Luka ih nganmi a i. Luka cu sibawi a i ih thil cangmi cekci ngankhum dingah a ralring ngaitu a i. A nganmi cabu panih, Luka Thuthang Ṭha leh Forhthlah pawl ih Ṭuanṭuannak, cabu cu Grik mi “Theofilas” sinah a kuat. Asinain Grik Khristian pawl le Judah Khristian hrang ah a tumtah khaw a i thei (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1">1.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Forhthlah cabu hi Khrih suah hnuk kum 60–64 karlak hrawngah nganmi a i men thei, zangahtihle a cabu cu Paul thawnginn ih a suah hlan thu in a ne ter. Luka hi Forhthlah Paul thawn khual an tlawn khat, curuangah Forhthlah cabu hi Antiok khawpi ah a ngan a i thei. Forhthlah cabu cu Jesuh Khrih ih vancung kainak in a thok ih Luka Thuthang Ṭha cabu pehtu a i. Luka nih Forhthlah a ngan duhsatnak hi Luka Thuthang Ṭha a ngan duhsatnak thawn a ṭiahfa. Luka nih, an sinih zirhmi thu pawl hi Theofilas le Khristian pawl nih ṭhangai in cingkeng seu la, a duh. Curuangah Khristian pawl zangtih in an karhzai tihmi le Jesuh nunnak ih thil cangmi cekci cu felfai ngai in a ngan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Forhthlah pawl ih Ṭuanṭuannak cabu nih, Kawhhran hmasa pawl zohṭhip tlak an sihnak leh Jesuh ah zupnak nei in zangtih mangin an nung, tihmi kan na sim. Forhthlah pawl zohṭhip tlak an sihnak nih, thuthang ṭha karhzainak ah Thlarau Thianghlim ih huham cahnak rinsat a ṭulzia, kan na hmuh.</para>
  <para style="iot">Thutlangpi</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Hmasabik ah, dungthluntu pawl cungah Thlarau Thianghlim a rong ṭum ih Kawhhran ṭhan a thok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 1:1-8:1">1.1—8.1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cun, Kawhhran cu hrem a tuar ih Jerusalem leng tiangah karhzai a thok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 8:2-12:23">8.2—12.23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cuhnuk ah, Paul veikhatnak khual a tlawn <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 12:24-14:28">12.24—14.28</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Cun, zumtu thar pawl ih dilmi ṭhencat dingah Jerusalem ah khonsil an tuah <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15.1–35</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cule, Paul veinihnak khual a tlawn <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15.36—18.22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">6. Cuhnuk ah, Paul veithumnak khual a tlawn <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 18:23-20:38">18.23—20.38</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">7. Cun, Jerusalem khua ah Paul an tlai <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 21:1-26:32">21.1—26.32</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">8. Netabik ah, Rom khua ah Paul an kuat <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ACT 27:1-28:31">27.1—28.31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk 1.1–4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maw Theofilas:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Jesuh ih ṭuanṭuan a thawh ihsin vancung ih lak a ih hlan tiang a tuahmi le a zirhmi hmahhmah pawl cu ka cabu hmasa sungah ka ngan. <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />Vancung ih lak a ih hlanah, a hril cia hnei mi a forhthlah pawl cu Thlarau Thianghlim ih cahnak huham thawn thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />A thih hnuk ni sawmli sung an sinah vei tamngai a phuanglang fa ih, a nung rori tihmi nemhngetnak tamngai a pe hnei. Ama cu an hmu ih Pathian Uknak thu thawn pehpar fami pawl a sim hnei. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk 24.49</ref></char></note>Cule hmun khatih an hmuahkhawm fak lai ah,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hmuahkhawm fak lai ah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">an sinih a um lai ah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">anni thawn caw an eikhat lai ah.</char></note> an sinah hitihin thu a pe: “Jerusalem hi suahsan hlah uh. Cunakin ka Pa ih laksawng nan ta pek ding mi, ka sinih nan fiah cemmi thutiam khi, hngak sawn uh. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Joh 1.33</ref></char></note>Johan cu nih ti thawn baptisma nan ta pe. Asinain ni rei lo teah Thlarau Thianghlim thawn baptisma pek nan i thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesuh Vancung Kainak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Marka 16.19–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24.50–53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Forhthlah pawl cu Jesuh thawn an hmuahfak lai ah anni nih, “Bawipa, atun can ah Israel pawl sinah Uknak cu na pe sal thok maw?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ani nih an sinah, “Pa nih a thuneihnak sungih a siahmi caan, a ihlole a cuvai tikcu cu nanmai fiah ding a i lo. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28.19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar 16.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk 24.47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref></char></note>Asinain Thlarau Thianghlim nan sinih a rong tian tikah huham cahnak thawn nan khat thok ih Jerusalem khawpi, Judea ram, Samaria ram hmahhmah le leilung tlun a deng tiang ka na fiahpittu nan si thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24.50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note>Cutih in a sip colh hnukah, an mit hmuh rori ah ani cu van ah lak a i, cule khawdur nih a phen ih an hmu thiam i lo.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Cun a hang kainak van la an zoh ciahco laiah, puan rang hru mi mi panih hmakhatte ah an hramah an rong ding ih, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />“Galilee mi pawl, zangah van la zoh in nan ding ciahco? Nan sin in van ih a kaimi Jesuh hi, van ih a kai lai nan hmuh mang cekci in a rong kir sal leh thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas Airawltu Hrilnak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matthai 27.3–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Cule forhthlah pawl cu Olif Tlang in Jerusalem ah an kir, cucu Jerusalem in peng hrek tluk a hla. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10.2–4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar 3.16–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk 6.14–16</ref></char></note>Cun khua an tian tikah, Peter, Johan, James, Andru, Filip, Thomas, Bartholomeo, Matthai, Alfias ih fapa James, phun ṭantu Simon le James ih fapa Judas pawl umnak tlunta khan ah an lut. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Numi pawl, Jesuh ih nu Mary le Jesuh ih naule pawl thawn an zatein an hmuakkhawm fa ih lung khat pu in thlacamnak cat loin an nei.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Cun cuvai can ah zumtu hmuakkhawm fa minung 120 hrawng lakah, Peter cu a hang ding ih, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“U le nau pawl, Thlarau Thianghlim nih David ih hmurka hmangin a sip ciami Jesuh tlaitu pawl ṭhita hneitu Judas ih thuhla Ca Thianghlim ih sipmi cu a kim ṭul. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Zangahtihle Judas cu kan lakih siar telmi a i ve ih, hivai ṭuanṭuannak ah covo a nei ve,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18,19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat 27.3–8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>(Judas cu thilsual a tuahmi man ih a ngahmi tangka in hmunram pakhat a lei ih cuvai lo sungah a bah ih a thi; a pum a kek ih a hril pawl khaw a pawt colh. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Cun cuvai thu cu Jerusalem ih a ummi mi hmahhmah nih an fiah ih anma ṭon in cuvai hmunram cu Akeldama tiah an ti; a sullam cu, “Thisen Hmunram,” tihnak a i.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Peter nih, “Zangahtihle Saam cabu sungah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“ ‘A inn cu lawng sehla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">A sungah hukhaw um hlah seu,’ tiah ngan ciami a um.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Cule hmun dang ah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Midang nih a ṭuanṭuan cu la seu,’ tiah a um.<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.21,22 a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3.21</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Luk 24.51</ref></char>
    </note>“Curuangah kan sinih a ummi lak sungin Bawipa Jesuh thawhsalnak fiahpittu ah mi pakhat kan hril a ṭul. Ama cu Bawi Jesuh kan lak ih lut le suak in a um sung hmahhmah ah kan sinih um ringring ve tu a i thok. Johan nih Baptisma thu a sipnak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21,22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Johan nih Baptisma thu a sipnak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Johan nih baptisma a peknak.</char></note> ih thokin Jesuh van ih lak a ih ni tiang, kan lak ih a tel ve tu a i thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Cule minung panih ih hmin an pe. Barsabbas tiah kawhmi Josef (Justus tiah khaw ih an kawhmi), le Matthias an si. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Cule thla an cam ih, “Bawipa, nang cu mi hmahhmah ih thinlung fiah colhtu na i; hi panih lakah hutu deuh na hril tihmi kan ron fiahter; <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />a co dingmi hmunah kan na fehtatu Judas ih can-ai ah na forhthlah pawl lakih ṭuanvo la dingah na hrilmi cu kan ron fiangter hram,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Cule an panih sungah hutu hi forhthlah a i thok tih an fiahnak dingah camcawhfung an zuk ih Matthias nih a ngah. Matthias cu forhthlah hleikhat pawl sinah an betcih.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Thlarau Thianghlim a Rong Tiang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Pentikos ni a tian tikah zumtu hmahhmah cu hmun khat ah an um. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Cun hmakhatte ah van in zil fak ngai zuang mangin thawngvang a rong tiang ih an umnak inn pumpi in a khat colh. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Cule meisa alh mang a i mi, a ṭhenfa mi lei pawl cu an sinah an lang ih, minung pakhat vek cungah an ṭhumfa. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />An zatein Thlarau Thianghlim in an khat colh ih Thlarau nih ṭon theinak a pek hnei mangin ṭon dangdang in an ṭon.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Leitlun khuakakip in a tiangmi, biaknak la ah a zuamfa ngaimi, leh Judah mi pawl cu Jerusalem ah an um laifang a i. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Cuvai ṭon dangdang ih an ṭonmi thawngvang an theih tikah mipi pawl cu an tiang ih an hmuakkhawm fa. Cuvai a tiangmi mipi pawl nih zumtu pawl ih ṭon cu anma ih ṭon mang in an theih vek tikah an mang a bang ngai. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Mangbang le khawruahhar in, “Hih a ṭon berbo tu pawl hi Galilee mi an i ko lo maw? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Zangtih in kanma kan suahkeh ṭon mangin kan thei thiam? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Kan cu Parthia ram, Media ram, Elam ram, Mesopotamia ram, Judea ram, Kappadosia ram, Pontas ram, Asia ram, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Frizia ram, Pamfilia ram, Izipt ram le Libia ramsung Sairin khaw hram pawl in a tiangmi kan i. Mi hrekkhat cu Rom khua in a tiangmi kan i ih, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Judah mi le Judah biaknak ih a luttu Zentail mi pawl kan i. Mi hrekkhat cu Krete tikulh le Arabia ram in kan tiang — asinain Pathian nih a huham thawn thil mak ngai a tuahmi thu anma ih ṭon ih an sip tikah kanma ṭon mangin kan thei,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti fa. <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />An zatein, mangbang le awloksong in, “Aihih a sullam zangtu la i na?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti fa.<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Asinain midang pawl nih, “Hi pawl hi wine ri hmah u e!” tiah zohsuam ngai in an ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter ih Thusipnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Cun Peter cu a dang forhthlah hleikhat lakah a hang ding ih, aw thang ngai in an sinah: “Judah mi pawl le Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl, hivai hi fiah uhla, ka ṭonkam pawl hi ngai uh. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Nan ruah mangin hi pawl hi an ri lo; mawla nazi pakua kau a i rih. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Hivai hi profet Joel nih:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“ ‘Ni neta ah cun hitih in a i thok; Pathian nih a ti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Minung hmahhmah cungah ka Thlarau ka burh thok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Nan fapa pawl le nan fanu pawl nih profet thuphuan in thu an phuang thok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Nan mino pawl nih latnak pawl an hmu thok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Cun nan puhram pawl nih mang an man thok;<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Cule ka sal nu le sal pa pawl cung khawah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Cuvai can ah cun ka Thlarau ka burh thok ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Profet thuphuan in thu an phuang thok.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Cule van cungah mangbangza pawl le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">leilung ah hmuhsaknak pawl ka langter thok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Thisen, meisa le meikhu sah ngai a um thok;<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />A maktara mi le a sunglawimi Bawipa ih Ni a tian hlanah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ni cu a mawk thok ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">thlapa cu thisen ah a cang thok;<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Bawipa ih hmin a ko tu pawl hmahhmah cu rundam an i thok,’ tiah a sip cia mi khi a i.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Israel mi pawl, hi ṭonkam pawl hi ngai hnik uh! Nanma rori ih nan fiah mangin, Nazareth mi Jesuh hmangin Pathian nih nan lakih thilmak pawl, mangbangza pawl le hmuhsaknak pawl thawn nan sinih a nemhnget mi, <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat 27.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar 15.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk 23.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Joh 19.18</ref></char></note> Jesuh cu Pathian ih a fiahcianak le khawkhannak mangin nan sinah pek a i. Nan nih daan nei lo pawl kut in nan tlai ih nan khenbet ih nan that. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat 28.5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk 24.5</ref></char></note>Asinain Pathian nih thihnak in a thoter sal ih thihnak huham sungin a luatter cem. Zangahtihle ani cu thihnak ih tlaih theihmi a i lo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />David nih ani ih thuhla cu hitih in a sim:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“ ‘Bawipa cu ka hmai ah ka hmu ringring;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Ka vorhla ih a um ruangah ka hnin thok lo.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Curuangah ka thinlung cu a aipuang ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ka hmurka cu a lungawinak in a khat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Ka taksa ruangpum khaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ruahsatnak ah a cawlhnga thok.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Zangahtihle ka thlarau cu mithi khua ah na ramta thok lo ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Na mi thianghlim cu siatralnak a hmuah ding na siang fawn thok lo.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Nunnak zalam cu ka na fiahter cem ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Na umpitnak thawn lungawinak in ka na khat ter thok,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“U le nau pawl, kan pu David ih thu cu nan sinah fiang ngai in nan ta sim thok. David cu a thi ih an phum; a thlan khaw nihin ni tiang kan lakah a um. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Profet a i ih Pathian ih a kam ciami thu a fiah; ama David mangin a tesinfa pakhat khat cu siangpahrang tokheng ih to dingah Pathian nih thu a tiam. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Pathian nih hmaila caanah zangtu a tuah thok tih cu David nih a hmu cia; curuangah Khrih a thawhsalnak ding thu cu hitih in a sim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“ ‘Mithi khua ah ama cu a ramta thok lo ih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">a taksa ruangpi cu thlan sungah a ciamdah thok lo,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Pathian nih Jesuh cu thihnak in a thoter sal ih a fiahpittu cu kan zate hi kan si. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Curuangah Pathian nih a vorhla ah sunglawi ngai in a khaisang ih Pa ih a tiamkam mi Thlarau Thianghlim cu a sinah a pe. Cuvai a pekmi cu atun ih nan hmuhmi le nan theihmi hi a si. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Zangahtihle David cu vancung ah a hang kai lo; ama rori nih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Bawipa nih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">ka Bawipa sinah:<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Na ral pawl na ke tang, na ke cilnak ih ka canter hlan lo ka vorhla ah to,’ a ti,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Curuangah Israel miphun pawl hmahhmah nih hivai hi fiang ngai in fiah uh, nan khenbet mi Jesuh cu Pathian nih Bawi le Khrih ah a tuah cem,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Mipi pawl nih cuvai thu an theih tikah, an thinlung a khoih hnei ngai ih, Peter le forhthlah pawl sinah, “U le nau pawl, zangtu tuah lausing?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Cun Peter nih an sinah, “Nan sualnak pawl ngaihthiam a ih theinak dingah nan sual sir uhla Jesuh Khrih hmin in baptisma la uh; cule Thlarau Thianghlim laksawng nan co thok. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Zangahtihle thutiamkam cu nanma, nan tefa pawl le hmunhla ih a um mi pawl hrang khaw ah a i — Bawipa kan Pathian ih a kawhmi zate hrang khaw ah a i,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Cule thudang tamngai a sim hnei ih a forh hnei. “Tunsan misualral pawl lakin nanma le nanma humhim fa uh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />A thusipmi cu mi tamngai nih an zum ih baptisma an co; cuvai ni ah minung 3,000 hrawng nih an bet. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />An zatein forhthlah pawl sinin an zir ih, ti-caw ei khatnak le thlacam khatnak thawn pawlkop faknak an nei ringring.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumtu pawl Nundan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Cun mi hmahhmah ih thinlung ah ṭihnak a tiang, cule forhthlah pawl cu mangbangza le khawruahhar tamngai an tuah. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Forh 4.32–35</ref></char></note> Cun zumtu hmahhmah cu hmun khat ah an umkhat ih an neihmi thil zangkim in an hlawmfa. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />An neihmi pawl le thilri pawl an zuar ih, an ṭuldan ih zirin an zatein an zem fa. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ni cang Biakinn ah an hmuakkhawm fa. Inn khat hnuk inn khat caw an ṭawm fa ih lungawinak le tangdornak thinlung thawn caw an ei khat. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Pathian an thangṭhat ih, mi hmahhmah sinin mithmai ṭha an co. Cule ni cang in Bawipa nih rundamnak cotu pawl cu an sinah a bet hnei.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Keze Damternak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ni khat ah Peter le Johan cu thlacam tikcu simla nazi pathum ah Biakinn ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Cun a suahkeh in keze mi pakhat cu Biakinn a fehtu pawl sinin bopnak hler dingah Kotka Mawi tih kawhmi Biakinn kotka ah ni cang in an to ter. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Peter le Johan Biakinn sung an luh cu a hmu hnei ih bopnak pe dingah a hler hnei. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peter nih Johan thawn cuvai pa cu mit ṭhep loin an zoh ih, “Kan zoh hnik,” tiah Peter nih a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Cun an sinin thil pakhat khat tal ngah ding ruahsat in a zoh hnei. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Cule Peter nih, “Sui le ngun ka nei lo; asinain ka neihmi ta ka pe: Nazareth mi Jesuh Khrih hmin in hang ding la feh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Cule a vorhla kut in a awh ih a ding ter. Hmakhatte ah a ke le kemit pawl cu an dam. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />A hang tho ih a ke in a ding, cule a feh. Feh pah, sawsok fa pah in Pathian a thangṭhat ih Peter le Johan thawn Biakinn sungah a lut. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Cutih in a feh thei le Pathian a thangṭhat cu mi hmahhmah nih an hmu. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Biakinn ih Kotka Mawi ah bopnak thil mi hlertu khi a si tih an fiah tikah an mang a bang ih an khawruah a har ngai.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter ih Thusip Veinihnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Cuvai pa cu Solomon Zauhliap tihmi ah Peter le Johan thawn a um tih an hmuh tikah mipi pawl cu mangbang in an sinah an va zuang. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Cuvai cu Peter nih a hmuh tikah an sinah, “Israel mi pawl, zangruangah hi thu ah nan mang a bang ih kanma la mit ṭheṭhep loin kan na zoh? Kanmai thil tihtheinak le thil ṭha kan tuahnak ruangah hi pa kan fehter thei ah maw nan ruat? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Abraham, Isak, le Jakob ih Pathian, kan pupa pawl ih Pathian nih a siahhlawh Jesuh cu sunloihnak a pe cem. Asinain thuneitu pawl ih kut ah nan pe. Pilat nih thlah dingin thu a ṭhen cia mi hman ama ih mithmuh rori ah nan hnong. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat 27.15–23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar 15.6–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk 23.13–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Joh 19.12–15</ref></char></note>Mi thianghlim le mi dingfel cu nan hnong ih, mi thattu sawn nan ta thlahsak dingah nan hler. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Cule nunnak petu cu nan that, asinain Pathian nih thihnak in a thoter sal ih — cuvai thu fiahpittu cu kanma hi kan si. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Jesuh hmin ih huham ruangah hivai keze pa nih damnak a ngah. Nan hmuhmi le nan theihmi hi Jesuh ih hmin zupnak thawngin tuahmi a i. Nan zate ih nan hmuh colh mangin Jesuh zupnak in hivai pa hi damter a i.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Curuangah u le nau pawl, nan hruaitu pawl ih an tuah mangin, nan fiah lo ruangah nan tuah ve mi a i, tih ka fiah. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Khrih cu harsatnak a tuar thok tiah Pathian nih profet pawl hmahhmah kaa in a sipcia mi pawl cu a famkimter cem. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Curuangah nan sualnak ngaihthiam a sih theinak dingah sir fa uhla Pathian sinah kir uh. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Cule Bawipa sinin tharthawh faknak tikcu a tiang thok ih nan hrangih a hrilcia mi Khrih tihmi Jesuh cu nan sinah nan ta pe thok. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Pathian nih hlanlaine in a profet thianghlim pawl hmahhmah ih kaa in a phuan cia mangin, zanghmahhmah tuahtharsal tikcu a kim hlanlo Jesuh cu vancung ah a um thok. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Zangahtihle Moses nih, ‘Bawipa nan Pathian nih kei ka na thlah mangin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei ka na thlah mangin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kei mangin.</char></note> nan miphun a si mi profet pakhat nan sinah a thlah thok. Ani ih nan ta sipmi hmahhmah cu nan thlun colh a ṭul. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Cuvai profet ih sipmi thu a ngai lotu minung cu Pathian miphun sung in dawi a i thok ih siatsuah a i thok,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Cule thuphuan ding a neitu profet hmahhmah, profet Samuel thokin a hnukih a tiangmi profet pawl khaw nih, an zatein tunsan thu pawl hi an sipcolh cia mi a i. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Nan cu Pathian nih kan pupa pawl sinih a tuahmi thukam cotu le profet pawl ih tefa nan i. Abraham sinah, ‘Na tesinfa sung in leilung tlunih mi hmahhmah cu thlawsuahnak ka pe thok,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Curuangah nan ṭhat lonak ihsin nan kir ih nan ta thlawsuah theinak dingah Pathian nih a siahhlawh Jesuh cu a thoter sal hnukah a hmasabik ah nan sinah a thlah,” tiah a let hnei.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Peter le Johan An Tlai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Cutih in mipi pawl sinih thu an sip berbo lai ah puithiam pawl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">puithiam pawl; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">puithiam upa pawl, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> le biakinn kiltu bawi le Sadusi pawl an tiang. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Mithi pawl an nung sal thok tih fiangternak ah Jesuh cu thihnak in a tho sal tiah forhthlah panih nih an phuan le an zirh ruangah an thin a phang ngai. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Curuangah cuvai forhthlah panih cu an tlai ih zanla a kim cem ruangah a zingthlala sun tiang thawng ah an thla. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Sikhawsehla an thusipmi a theitu mi tamngai nih an zum; a zumtu pawl cu an karh sinsin ih, mi 5,000 tluk an kim.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />A zingthlala sun ah Judah mi hruaitu pawl, upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl cu Jerusalem ah an hmuakkhawm fa. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Puithiam Lubik Annas, Kaiafas, Johan, Alexander le Puithiam Lubik ih sungkhat dang pawl khaw an um ve. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Cun an laifang ih an dinter hnukah, “Zangtu huham cahnak asihlole hutu ih hmin in hivai thil hi nan tuah?” tiah an sut.<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Cule Peter cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a khat ih an sinah, “Mipi hruaitu pawl le upa pawl, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />nihin sun ah hi keze pa a damnak thu le a cungih thilṭha tuahmi thu kan na sut a sih ahcun, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />nan zate le Israel mipi hmahhmah ih nan fiah colh dingmi cu hivai hi a i: nan hmai ih a dingmi pa a fimdamnak hi Nazareth mi — thinglamtah cungih nan thahmi, thihnak in Pathian ih a thawhter salmi Jesuh Khrih ih hmin in a si. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Jesuh thu ah Ca Thianghlim nih:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“ ‘Inn satu pawl ih nan hnonmi lung cu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">a kil ih lung thupi bik ah a cang,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Rundamnak cu hutu dang sin khawah a um lo; zangahtihle rundam kan sih theinak dingah van tang minung lakah hmin dang a um lo,” tiah Peter nih a ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Khonsil upa pawl nih Peter le Johan cu fitnak le thiamnak a nei lomi mi menmen an i nain zangtlukin an ral a ṭha tih an hmuh tikah an mang a bang ngai. Cule anni cu Jesuh ih rualpi an sih khi an fiah sal. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Asinain an fimdamter mi pa cu Peter le Johan hramih a din ringring ruangah an ṭon theimi zangkhaw a um lo. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Curuangah Khonsil khan sungin suak dingah thu an pe ih anma hlang thu an rel. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Zangtih in kan tuah thok? Huhman nih an tuah thei lomi hmuhsaknak thilmak an tuah tih cu Jerusalem khawsung ih a ummi hmahhmah nih an thei colh cem ih hukhaw ih el theihmi a i lo. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Asinain hivai thu hi mipi sinih a karhzai lonak dingah, Jesuh hmin in hutu sin khawah thu sim i hlah uh, tiah kan hringhro thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Cule an ko kir sal ih, Jesuh hmin in thu zirh lo ding le thu sim hrimhrim lo dingin an dawn. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Asinain Peter le Johan nih, “Nanmai thu ngai maw Pathian ih thu ngai hi Pathian hmai ah a dik sawn? nanma tein ṭhen hnik uh! <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Zangahtihle kanma rori ih kan hmuhmi le kan theihmi cu sim loin kan um thei lo,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Curuangah Khonsil upa pawl nih rauh deuh in an hringhro ih an thlah. Mi hmahhmah nih an lakih thil a cangmi an hmu ih Pathian an thangṭhat ruangah forhthlah pawl hrem cu a cang thei lo tiah an ruat. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Hmuhsaknak ah damnak a ngahtu pa hi kum sawmli tlun a i.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ralṭhatnak ding Thla An Cam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Peter le Johan cu thlah an ih cangka in an rualpi pawl sinah an kir, puithiam upa pawl le upa pawl ih an sipmi thu pawl cu an sim. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Cuvai thu cu an theih tikah hmunkhatte ah Pathian sinah an aw suahin thla an cam ih, “Van le leilung, tifingriat le a sungih ummi hmahhmah a tuahtu, maw Cungnungbik Bawipa, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Na Thlarau Thianghlim hmangin na siahhlawh kan pu David sinah thu na sim ih:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“ ‘Zangah Zentail mi pawl hi an thin a se?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Zangah minung pawl hi thil lolak men an tuah?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Bawipa le Khrih dokalh dingah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">leilung siangpahrang pawl an tuahsifa ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Uktu bawi pawl thawn hmun khatah an hmuakkhawm fa,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luk 23.7–11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Joh 18.28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref></char>
    </note> Zangahtihle hriak na culh mi na Siahhlawh Thianghlim Jesuh dokalh dingah Herod le Pontius Pilat cu khawpi sungah Zentail mi pawl le Israel mi pawl thawn an hmuakkhawm fa taktak. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Na huham le na tumtahnak in a cang leh thok tih ih na khiah ciami kimter colh dingah an hmuakkhawm fa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Maw Bawipa, a tun ah anni nih kan na hringhro mi khaw hi nangma nih kan ron theihsak hram la kan na sal pawl nih na thu cu ralṭha ngai in kan sip theinak dingah kan bawm hram. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Na Siahhlawh Thianghlim Jesuh hmin in mi fimdamter dingah na ban ron pharh hram la hmuhsaknak le khawruahhar thil pawl tuah theinak kan ron pe hram,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Thla an cam colh tikah an hmuakkhawm faknak hmun cu a hnin colh. Thlarau Thianghlim in an khat ih Pathian thu cu ralṭha ngai in an phuang.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumtu pawl An Neihmi An Ṭawm fa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">Forh 2.44</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:45">45</ref></char>
    </note> Zumtu pawl cu thinlung le ruahnak hmunkhat an nei. Hutu khaw nih an neihmi thilri cu, ka bulta a si, an ti lo; an neihmi hmahhmah cu pakhat le pakhat an ṭawm fa. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Bawi Jesuh thawhsalnak thu cu forhthlah pawl nih a nasa ngaimi huham thawn an sim ih Pathian nih an zate tlunah thlawsuah tamngai a ron burh. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />An lakah hutu khaw a tlasam mi an um lo. Hmunram a neitu le inn a neitu pawl nih an hmunram le an inn pawl cu an zuar ih an ngahmi tangka cu, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />forhthlah pawl kutah an ap. Cule cuvai tangka cu a ṭulsamtu pawl ih ṭulnak mangin an zem.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Cun Saipras tikulh ih a suakmi Levi mi, forhthlah pawl nih Barnabas tiah an kawhmi (Barnabas tih cu “Thazang petu ih Fapa” tihnak a i), Joses nih, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />a neihmi hmunram cu a zuar ih a ngahmi tangka cu forhthlah pawl ih kut sungah a ap.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias le Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ananias tih kawhmi pa le a nupi Safira cu an neihmi an zuar ih, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />a nupi ih fiahpitnak thawn a man hrekkhat cu an sup ih a hrekkhat cu forhthlah pawl ih kutah an ap. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Asinain Peter nih, “Ananias, Thlarau Thianghlim sinah thuphan sim ding le na hmunram man hrekkhat sup dingin zangruangah Seihtan nih na thinlung ta luahkhat? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Na zuar hlanah na ta a i kau lo maw? Na zuar hnuk khawah nangma na thuneihnak sungah a um kau law mawh? Zangruangah hi mangin tuah ding hi na thinlung sungin na tum? Minung na deu a i lo, Pathian na deu sawn a i,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananias cu cuvai ṭonkam pawl a theih tikah a ok ih a hnuk a cat. Cule cuvai thu a theitu hmahhmah cu an tuk a sum colh. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Cun tlangval pawl an tho ih a ruak cu puan thawn an tuam hnukah lengah an zawn ih an phum.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Nazi pathum rei hnukah zang a cang tih fiah lo in a nupi cu a tiang ve. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Cule Peter nih a sinah, “Aizat hi nan hmunram zuar man zate a i maw? Ka sim hnik” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Ani nih, “Hngi, kan hmunram man zate a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Cutikah Peter nih, “Bawipa ih thlarau hneksak dingah zangtih in nan lung a rual? Na pasal phumtu tlangval pawl cu suahka hram ah an um rih; nang khaw lengah ta zawn eng ve thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Hmakhatte ah ani khaw Peter ih ke hram ah a ok ih a thi. Cule tlangval pawl an tiang ih a thi cem tih an hmu. A lengah an zawn ih a pasal ih hramah an phum. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Cule kawhhran mipi zate le hivai thu a theitu hmahhmah cu ṭihnak in an khat.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hmuhsaknak pawl le Mangbangza pawl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Cun forhthlah pawl nih mipi pawl lakah hmuhsaknak le mangbangza tamngai an tuah. Zumtu pawl hmahhmah cu Solomon Zauhliap ah an hmuakkhawm fa. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mipi nih an zohsang ngai nan, hutu khaw an sinah an tel ngam taktak lo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Bawipa a zumtu numi le pami tamngai cu an pawlkom ah tam sinsin in an lut. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Curuangah mifak tamngai cu zalam ah an zawn ih Peter an hramih a feh tikah a thlam nih phen hliap hnei thei dingin ihkhun le pher cungah an thlim. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Cule khaw kiangkap in Jerusalem khawpi ah mipi pawl an tiang ih mifak pawl le khawsia molhmi pawl cu an tianpit ih an zatein an damter colh.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Forhthlah pawl Hremnak An Tuar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Puithiam Lubik le a hramih um tu Sadusi pawl hmahhmah cu an dingih an nahsuah ih an thin a se ngai. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Forhthlah pawl cu an tlai ih mipi thawnginn ah an thla. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Asinain Bawipa ih vancungmi nih zan ah thawnginn suahka pawl cu a hong ih a lengah a suah hnei. Cule an sinah, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Va feh uhla, Biakinn sungah ding in, hi nunnak thu hmahhmah hi va sim uh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Cuvai thu an theih tikah, zingmaw ngai in Biakinn ah an feh ih thuzirh an thok.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Culai fangah Puithiam Lubik le a hramih um mi pawl cu an tiang ih, Khonsil thurelnak tuah dingah Israel tlangsuak pawl hmahhmah an ko khawm. Cule thawnginn ihsin forhthlah pawl ṭhi dingah mi an hei thlah. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Asinain thawnginn bawi pawl an va tian tikah, thawnginn ah an va hmu lo; curuangah an kirsal ih Khonsil upa pawl an sim: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Thawnginn cu ṭha in a hrenfa kau, suahka hramah a kiltu pawl an ding, a sungah hutukhaw kan hmu lo,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Cuvai thu cu puithiam upa pawl le Biakinn kiltu bawi nih an theih tikah zang a cang la si na, tiah khawruahhar in an um. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Cule mi pakhat a tiang ih, “Ngaihnik uh, Thawnginn ih nan thlak mi pawl khi Biakinn ah an um ih mipi pawl thu an zirh berbo,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Cun Biakinn kiltu bawi cu a kuttang pawl thawn an va feh ih forhthlah pawl cu an va ṭhi sal. Hramhram in an ṭhi lo, zangahtihle misenpi pawl nih lung in kan na nam pang thok tih an phang.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Cun Forhthlah pawl cu an ron ṭhi ih Khonsil hmaiah an dingter. Cule Puithiam Lubik nih thu a sut hnei, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27.25</ref></char></note> “Hi pa ih hmin in thuzirh i hlah uh tiah fak ngai in thu nan ta pe i lo maw? Nan thuzirhmi cu Jerusalem khawpi nan khatter cem ih hi pa ih thisen mawh kan cungah ṭilhter nan tum,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Peter le a dang forhthlah pawl nih, “Minung thu nakin Pathian thu kan ngai sawn thok. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Thinglamtah cungih nan thlai thah mi Jesuh cu kan pupa pawl ih Pathian nih a thoter sal cem. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Israel mi pawl sual sirnak le ngaihthiamnak pe dingah Pathian nih Hruaitu le Rundamtu dingah a vorhla ah a khaisang cem. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Hi thil hmahhmah a fiahpittu cu kanma hi kan si; Pathian nih a thu ngaitu pawl sinah a pekmi Thlarau Thianghlim khaw hi thu fiahpittu a i ve,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Cuvai thu an theih tikah, an thin a se tuk lawmlam ih forhthlah pawl cu thah colh an duh. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Asinain Khonsil lakih tel Farasi, a hmin Gamaliel, Daan zirhtu le mi hmahhmah ih upatmi pa cu a hang ding ih, forhthlah pawl cu a lengah tawite sung suak ter dingin thu a pe. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Cule an sinah, “Israel mi pawl, hi pawl cungih thil nan tuahdingmi hi ralring laiuhcih. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Zangahtihle aihlan ah Theudas tihmi pa a suak ih, ama le ma mithupi pakhat ka i a ti fa ih, minung 400 hrawng nih an thlun. Asinain thah a tuar ih a dungthluntu pawl cu an ṭekdarh colh ih zanghman lo ah a cang. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Cu hnukah mipum siar lai ah Galilee mi Judas a hang suak ih mi tamngai nih an thlun. Asinain thah a i ve ih a dungthluntu pawl cu an ṭekdarh colh. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Curuangah atun thu ah nan ta sim, hi pawl hi hrial uhla anma tein umter uh; zangahtihle an tumtahmi le an tuahmi hi minung ih thokmi a ih ahcun a riaral kau thok. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Asinain Pathian ih tuahmi a ih ahcun nan neh thei cuang thok lo. Pathian dodaltu sawnah nan cang thok,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Curuangah Khonsil upa pawl nih Gamaliel ih ruahnak pekmi cu an thlun. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Cule forhthlah pawl cu an ko ih an thawi hnukah Jesuh ih hmin in thu sim i lo dingah thu an pe ih an thlah. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Jesuh ih hmin ruangah ningzahnak tuar tlak ih ruah an ih cu an lung a awi ngai ih, Khonsil upa pawl sinin an suak. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Cule ni cangcang in Biakinn sung le inn khat hnuk inn khat ah, Jesuh cu Khrih a i tihmi thuthangṭha zirh le phuan an cawlhnga lo.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Bawmtu Pasarih Hrilnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Cun tikcu rei deuh hnukah, zumtu an karhzai vivo ih Hebru mi pawl le Grik ṭon hmang Judah mi pawl karlak ah thubuai a um. Grik ṭon a hmangtu Judah mi pawl nih ni cang thil an zep tikah an nuhmei pawl nih an co ding zat an co lo, tiah thu a um. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Cutikah forhthlah hleinih pawl nih zumtu pawl hmahhmah cu hmun khatah an ko khawm ih, “Pathian thu sipphuan daithlang in cabuai ṭuan kan ṭuan a sih ahcun a dik thok lo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Curuangah u le nau pawl, nanma lakah mi hminṭha, Thlarau Thianghlim le fitnak in a khatmi mi pasarih hril uhla anni pawl cu hivai ṭuanvo hi kan pe thok. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Kan cu thlacamnak le thusipnak ah kan pefa thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Cule cuvai thu nih mipi hmahhmah lung a awiter ih zupnak le Thlarau Thianghlim ih a khatmi Stefen, Filip, Prokhoras, Nikanor, Timon, Parmenas, le Antiok khua ihsin Judah biaknak ih a luttu Zentail mi Nikolaus pawl an hril. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />An pasarih in forhthlah pawl sinah an fehpit ih an lu tlunah an kut an suang ih thla an cam sak.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Cule Pathian thu cu a karhzai. Zumtu pawl khaw Jerusalem khuapi sungah an karh mepmo ih puithiam tamngai nih an zupnak cu an pom ve.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stefen An Tlai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Pathian ih thlawsuah mi le cahnak huham thawn a khatmi Stefen cu misenpi lakah khawruahhar le hmuhsaknak mak ngaingai tamngai a tuah. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Cun miluat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">miluat pawl: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hivai minung pawl cu sal a i ta dahmi Judah mi pawl an i, asinain sal in a luat mi pawl an i.</char></note> pawl ih Sinakok tih ih an kawh mi sungin mi hrekkhat pawl nih Stefen cu an dokalh. Cuvai dokalhnak ah cun Sairin ram, Alexandria khua, Silisia ram le Asia ram ih Judah mi pawl an tel. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Asinain Stefen cu Thlarau nih fitnak a pe ih a ṭon tikah hutu khaw nih an el thei lo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Cun mi hrekkhat cu, “Moses le Pathian thangsiat in a ṭon kan thei,” tiah ti dingah nawhthuh an pe. <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Cutih in misenpi pawl, upa pawl le Daanthiam pawl cu thinse kau in an forh. Stefen cu an tlai ih Khonsil upa hmai ah an suahpit. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Cule fiahpittu diklo pawl cu an tiang ih, “Hi pa nih kan Biakinn Thianghlim le Moses Daan khaw hi dokalh in a ṭon ringring. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Nazareth mi Jesuh nih hi hmun hi a ṭhiatbal thok ih, Moses ih kan na pekmi nunphung pawl a thleng colh thok, tiah a ṭon lai kan thei,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Khonsil ih a totu hmahhmah nih Stefen cu an zoh ih a mithmai cu vancungmi mithmai mangin an hmu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stefen ih Thusipnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Puithiam Lubik nih Stefen cu, “Hitih ih an tihmi hi a si taktak maw?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Cule Stefen nih, “U le nau, pa le pawl, ka ngaihnik uh! Kan pu Abraham cu Haran ah um dingih a feh hlanah Mesopotamia ah Pathian sunlawinak a sinah a rong lang ih, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />a sinah, ‘Na sungkhat le na ram ramta pit in ta hmuh dingmi ramah feh,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Cutih in Khaldea ram in a suak ih Haran khua ah a um. A pa ih thih hnukah atun nan umnak ramah Pathian nih a thawnter. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Cuva cu zangtu ro khaw a pe lo, a ke cilnak ding hrang daih hman a pe lo; asinain Abraham nih tefa a nei lo kau na in, hi ram hi nangma le na tesinfa pawl ih ta a si thok, tiah thu a kam. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Cun Pathian nih a sinah, ‘Na tesinfa pawl cu ram dang ah an um thok; cuvai ram ah sal an cang thok ih kum 400 sung hremnak an tuar thok. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Asinain an rianmi miphun cungah thuṭhennak ka nei thok ih, cuhnuk ah cuvai ram ihsin an suak thok ih hivai hmunah ka na be eng thok, tiah Pathian nih a ti,’ tiah a sim. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Cule Pathian nih Abraham sinah serhtannak cu a thukam hminhlitnak ah a pe. Curuangah Abraham nih Isak a hring ih niriat nakah a serh a tansak. Isak nih Jakob a hring ih Jakob nih cithlahtu pupa hleinih a hring.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Kan pupa pawl nih Josef cu an se-elsuah ih Izipt ramah sal ah an zuar. Asinain Pathian a sinah a um ih, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />a harsatnak sung in Pathian nih a runsuak. Cule Izipt siangpahrang Faro ih hmaiah mithmai ṭha le fitnak a pe. Faro nih Josef cu a ram pumpi le a innsang hmahhmah tlunah uktu ah a tuah. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Izipt ram le Kanan ram hmahhmah ah mangṭam a tlung ih harsatnak rauhngai a tiang. Kan pupa pawl khaw ei ding ticaw an nei lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Jakob nih Izipt ram ah ticaw a um tih a theih tikah a fapa pawl, kan pupa pawl cu a thlah hnei; cucu Izipt ram an tian hmasa biknak a i. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />A veinihnak Izipt ram an tian tikah Josef nih a unau pawl sinah a phuangfa ih Josef ih sungkhat pawl cu Faro ih mifiah ah an cang. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Curuangah Josef nih a pa Jakob le a sungkhat pawl sinah Izipt ramih vai dingin thu a cah. An zatein minung sawmsarih le panga an i. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Cule Jakob cu Izipt ram ah a feh; cuva ah ama le a fapa pawl cu an thi. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />An ruak cu Shekhem ah an thiar ih Abraham nih Hamor ih fale pawl sinah paisa thawn a leimi thlan ah an phum.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Pathian nih Abraham sinih thu a tiamkam mi a kimnak tikcu a nai mepmo tikah Izipt ramih a ummi kan phunpi pawl cu an pungṭhang. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Cule Izipt ram ah Josef fiah lotu siangpahrang dang a suah hlan tiangin an karhzai. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Cuvai pa nih kan pupa pawl cu ama ih hlawknak hrangah hmang hnei pit in a hrem hnei. Cule an tefa pawl khaw thi seuh tiah hramhram in a hlonter hnei. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Cuvai can ah Moses cu a suak ih Pathian mithmuh ah mimawi ngai a i. Thla thum sung a pa ih inn ah an kilkhawi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Cule an hlon ih Faro siangpahrang fanu nih a sar ih a fapa dingah a kilkhawi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Moses cu Izipt ram mi pawl ih fitnak hmahhmah zirh colh a i ih, a ṭonkam le a ṭuanṭuannak ah mi maktara a i.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Moses cu kum sawmli a kim tikah Israel tefa pawl va len duhnak thinlung a nei. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />An lakih mi pakhat dik lo ngai ih a tuar lai cu a hmu ih a hum, cule phu a la ih Izipt pa cu a that. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Zangahtihle Pathian nih anni luattertu dingah ka na hmang thok ih ka phunpi pawl khaw nih an fiahthiam thok, tiah a ruat nain an fiahthiam lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />A zingla ah Moses cu Israel mi panih an velhfak lai ah an sin a feh ih a rem hnei tum, ‘Milai pawl, nan cu unau nan i. Zangruangah pakhat le pakhat nan velfa?’ tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Asinain a innhram pa dik lo ih a titu pa nih Moses cu a til ih, ‘Hutu nih kan cungah uktu le thuṭhentu ah ta tuah? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Mahnia ih Izipt pa na thah mangin ka na thah na duh maw?’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Moses nih cucu a theih tikah Midian ramah a zuang; cuvai ram ah mikhual in a va um ih, fapa panih a nei.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Kum sawmli a liam hnukah, Sinai Tlang hram ih ramṭhing ah hrambur meisa alh lakin Moses sinah vancungmi a rong lang. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Moses nih cuvai cu a hmuh tikah a mang a bang ih zohhliah dingin a va naih. Cule Bawipa ih aw nih a sinah, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Kei cu na pupa pawl ih Pathian, Abraham ih Pathian, Isak le Jakob ih Pathian ka si,’ tiah a ti. Cule Moses cu a ṭhia ih a zoh ngam lo. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Cun Bawipa nih a sinah, ‘Na kedap cu phoihfa, zangahtihle na dinnak leilung hi hmun thianghlim a i. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Izipt ram ih ka minung pawl zanzaih tuarnak cu ka hmu. An aihramnak ka thei ih anma runsuak hnei dingah ka tiang. Atun ah ka pha, Izipt ramah ta thlah thok,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Moses cu, ‘Hutu nih kan tlunih uktu le thuṭhentu dingah ta tuah?’ tiah an hnawl dahmi pa a i. Hrambur lakih a langmi vancungmi ih bopnak thawn uktu le runsuaktu dingah Pathian ih thlahmi pa a i. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Izipt ram ih Israel mi pawl cu a runsuak hnei ih Izipt ram, Tipi Sen le ramṭhing lakah kum sawmli sung mangbangza le hmuhsaknak tamngai a tuah. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Moses cu Israel mi pawl sinah, ‘Pathian nih nan lakin nan hrangah kei mangin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei mangin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kei ka na thlah mangin.</char></note> profet a suakter thok,’ tiah a titu pa a si. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ani cu, Sinai Tlang cungah a sinih thu a simtu vancungmi le kan pupa pawl thawn ramṭhing ah a umtu khi a si ih, Pathian thu nung kan sinih a tian theinak dingah a cohlangtu khaw a si.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Kan pupa pawl nih a thu an thlun duh lo. An hnong ih an thinlung in Izipt ram ah kirhsal an duh sawn. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Curuangah Aaron sinah, ‘Kan hmai ih lamhmuhtu dingah pathian dangdang kan tuahsak; Izipt ram in kan na hruaisuaktu Moses hi zang a cang kan fiah lo,’ tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Curuangah caw zuk lem an tuah ih cuvai milem sinah thawinak an pe. Cule anma kut ih tuahmi ah an lung a awi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Cun Pathian nih a dungtut hnei ih, van ih ni, thlapa le arsi pawl a be ter hnei. Profet cabu sungah:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“ ‘Maw Israel mi pawl, kum sawmli sung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ramṭhing ih ramsa nan thah mi le thawinak pawl khi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ka sinah nan pe maw?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Molek ih puanthlam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nan pathian Refan ih arsi le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">biak dingih nan tuahmi zuklem cu nan phur.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Curuangah nan cu Babilon pawn la ah nan ta kuat thok,’ tiah a um.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Kan pupa nih ramṭhing ah fiahpittu Puanthlam cu an nei. Cuvai Puanthlam cu Pathian nih Moses sinih a lattermi pianhmang mangih sakmi a i. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kan pupa pawl nih cuvai puanthlam cu an pupa pawl sinin an ngah hnukah, Pathian nih an hmaika ah miphun pawl a dawisuak ih an ram an lak lai ah Joshua thawn an lut pit. Cuvai puanthlam cu David ih san tiangin a um. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />David cu Pathian ih mithmai ṭha a co ih Jakob ih Pathian<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jakob ih Pathian; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Israel mi pawl, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> umnak ding inn sa dingin a hler. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Asinain Solomon nih inn cu a sa.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Asinain Cungnungbik Pathian cu minung kutih tuahmi inn ah a um lo; profet ih sip mangin,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“ ‘Bawipa nih, Vancung hi ka siangpahrang tokheng a si ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Leilung hi ka ke siahnak a si, tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ka hrangah zangtumang inn maw ka na saksak thok?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Asihlole ka cawlhngatnak ding hmun cu khoitu ah a si?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Hi pawl hmahhmah hi ka kut ih tuahmi an i lo maw?’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Nan mi lungruh pawl le thinlung le naa serhtan lo pawl, nan pupa pawl mang thotho nan i: Thlarau Thianghlim nan dodal ringring. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Profet pawl lakah nan pupa pawl ih hrem lo mi pakhat tal an um maw? Mi dingfel pa tiang dingih a phuangtu pawl cu an that. Atun ah cuvai pa cu nan zuar ih nan that. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Vancungmi hmangin pekmi daan nan co nain, nan thlun lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lung in Stefen An Phom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Khonsil upa pawl nih Stefen thusipmi an theih tikah an thin a se tuk ih an hacang an rial. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Asinain Stefen cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a khat ih vancung a han zoh tikah Pathian sunlawinak le Pathian vorhla ih a dingmi Jesuh cu a han hmu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Cutikah, “Zohhnik uh! Van a hong fa ih Pathian vorhla ah Minung Fapa a ding ka hmu!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Cun Khonsil upa pawl cu thang ngai in an hek ih, an naa an phit, cule lungrual tein Stefen sinah zamrang ngai in an pha. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Khaw lengah an dawisuak ih lung in an phom. Fiahpittu pawl ih an hnipuan cu Saul an tihmi tlangval pa sinah an se. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Lung ih an nam lai ah Stefen cu Bawipa a ko ih, “Bawipa Jesuh, ka thlarau hi ron la hram!” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />A khuk a bil ih, “Bawipa, an sualnak hi cing hram hlah!” tiah tha ngai in a hek. Cutih ih a heh colh in a thi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Cun Stefen a thih cu Saul a lung a kim.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saul nih Kawhhran A Hrem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Cuvai ni in Jerusalem khawpi sungih kawhhran cungah hremnak rauhngai a tiang ih forhthlah pawl siarlo, an zatein Judea ram le Samaria ram ah an ṭekdarh colh. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Stefen cu Pathian a ṭihzahtu pawl nih an phum ih nasa ngai in an ṭah.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 22:4">Forh 22.4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9–11</ref></char>
    </note> Asinain Saul cu kawhhran siatsuah a thok; inn khat hnuk inn khat a lut ih zumtu numi le pami pawl cu a duk hnei ih thawng a thla hnei.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria Khua ah Filip ih Thuthangṭha Phuannak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />A ṭekdarh mi zumtu pawl cu an fehnak kip ah thuthangṭha an phuang. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filip cu Samaria khawpi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">khawpi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">khua, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> ah a feh ih an sinah Khrih ih thuhla a sim. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Cun mipi pawl nih Filip ih tuahmi thilmak pawl an thei ih an hmuh tikah, a sipmi thu pawl cu thinlung takin an ngai. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Zangahtihle thlarau thianglo pawl cu an molhmi minung pawl sungin aw thang ngai in an hek ih an suak; cule taksaze le keze pawl cu an dam. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Curuangah cuvai khawpi ah cu lungawinak tamngai a um.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Cun cuvai khua ah Simon an tihmi pa a um. Mi maktara ka i a ti fa ih, hlanah cun dawi hmangin Samaria khawmi pawl a mol hnei. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />An zatein mi fate bik in mi hnem bik tiang a thu an ngai ih, “Ani hi, ‘Maktara,’ tihmi Pathian ih cahnak huham a i,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Caan reipi dawi thiamnak hmangin a dawi hnei ruangah thinlung takin a thu an ngai. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Asinain Filip ih thuthang ṭha sipmi Pathian Uknak le Jesuh Khrih hmin thuhla an theih tikah an zum ih numi pawl le pami pawl khaw baptisma an co. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simon rori khaw a zum ve; baptisma a lak hnukah Filip cu a thlun. Filip ih mangbangza le hmuhsaknak thil a tuahmi pawl a hmuh tikah a mang a bang.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Jerusalem khawpi ih a ummi forhthlah pawl nih, Samaria khawmi pawl khaw Pathian thu an cohlang, tih an theih tikah an sinah Peter le Johan an thlah. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />An sinih an tian tikah, Thlarau Thianghlim an co theinak dingah an hrangah thla an cam. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Zangahtihle an lakih hutu sin khawah Thlarau Thianghlim a rong tiang rih lo; Bawi Jesuh hmin in baptisma kau an la rih. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Cule Peter le Johan nih an cungah an kut an suang ih Thlarau Thianghlim an co.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Forhthlah pawl ih kut suannak thawngin Thlarau pek an ih cu Simon nih a hmuh tikah paisa pe hnei pitin, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Ka kut ka suanmi pohpoh nih Thlarau Thianghlim an co theinak dingah hi thuneihnak hi ka pe ve uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Asinain Peter nih a sinah, “Pathian ih pekmi laksawng hi tangka thawn lei theih ih na ruah ruangah nangma cu na tangka thawn va riaral uh! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Pathian hmai ah na thinlung a dik lo ruangah kan ṭuanṭuanmi sungah na tel lo, covo khaw na nei lo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Curuangah hivai na sualralnak in sirfa la Bawipa sinah thlacam, na thinlung ih na tumtah mi hi ta ngaihthiam mahna. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Zangahtihle nahsuahnak ih khatmi le dingfel lonak ih ṭemṭawn mi na i, tih kan hmu,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Cule Simon nih, “Na sipmi thil pawl zangtu khaw ka cungih a tian lonak dingah Bawipa sinah thla ka cap sak hram,” tiah a hler.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Peter le Johan cu Bawipa ih thu an phuang ih an hmuhtonmi an sip hnukah Jerusalem khawpi an kirh la ah, Samaria khua hmun tamngai ah thuthang ṭha an sim.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip le Ethiopia Pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Bawipa ih vancungmi nih Filip sinah, “Tho la, thlangla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thlangla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sundir ah.</char></note> ah Jerusalem in Gaza fehnak zalam ah feh,” tiah a ti. (Atun cu hi zalam cu an hmang i lo.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Atun cu hi zalam cu an hmang i lo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hi zalam cu ramṭhing zalam a i.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27-28" />Filip cu a tho ih a feh. Cule Ethiopia pa pakhat, Ethiopia siangpahrang bawinu Kandake ih hlawnthil hmahhmah kilkhawitu bawi, thuneihnak sang ngai nei mi, tilkheimi pa, cu Pathian be dingah Jerusalem ah a feh. A kirhsal la ah, saileng cungah to in profet Isaiah cabu a siar berbo. <verse eid="ACT 8:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Thlarau Thianghlim nih Filip sinah, “Khivai saileng khi va naih la, a hram in feh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filip cu cuvaipa sinah a va zuang ih, profet Isaiah cabu a siar berbo tih a fiah tikah, “Na siar berbo mi hi a sullam fiah cim?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Cuvaipa nih, “Hutal nih ka na sipfiang lo ahcun zangtih in ka fiahthiam thok?” tiah a sawn. Cule cuvaipa nih Filip cu a saileng cungah kai in to dingah a sawm. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />A siar berbo mi Ca Thianghlim cu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Ani cu thah dingmi tuu mangin an hruai ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">A hmul mettu hmaiah tuu fano daite ih a um mangin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">a kaa a cip.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Hmuhsuam nautatnak a tuar, thuṭhensaknak dik a co lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">A cithlai pawl ih thuhla hutu nih a than i nawn thok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Zangahtihle leitlun ih a nunnak cu an laksak,” tihmi a i.<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Cuvaipa nih Filip cu, “Hivai profet ih sipmi hi hutu ih thu a sim tih ka sim hram, amaih thu maw mi dang ih thu a sim?” tiah a sut. <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Cun Filip nih, cuvai Ca Thianghlim in a thok ih, Jesuh ih Thuthang Ṭha cu a sim. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Cutih in zalam ah an feh vivo ih ti umnak hmun an tiang. Cule cuvai pa nih, “Hiva ah ti a um. Baptisma co dingah zangtu nih ka na dawnkham?” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" pubnumber="[37]" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 37: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Filip nih a sinah, “Na thinlung zaten na zup ahcun baptisma co ding na i,” tiah a ti. Cupa nih, “Ka zum; Jesuh Khrih cu Pathian Fapa a si tiah ka zum,” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Cule Ethiopia pa cu a saileng a ding ter ih Filip thawn ti sungah an ṭum ih, Filip nih baptisma a pe. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ti sungin an hang suah tikah Bawipa ih Thlarau nih Filip cu a la ih, cuvai bawi pa nih Filip cu a hmu i lo; asinain lungawi ngai in a feh. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Asinain Filip cu Azotas khawpi ah an hmu; Sisaria ah a feh ih zalam tluan khua cangcang ah Thuthang Ṭha a sim.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Saul ih Lungthlennak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Forhthlah 22.6–16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Cun Saul nih Bawipa ih dungthluntu pawl cu that dingin a hringhro hnei thotho. Puithiam Lubik sinah a feh ih, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Bawipa ih zalam a zawhtu numi pami tilo in tlai hnei pit in Jerusalem ih a ṭhittak hnei theinak dingah, Damaskas khawpi ih sinakok uktu pawl pek ding ca a la.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Cutih in khual a tlot lai, Damaskas khawpi a naih tikah, veikhatte ah van in tleunak nih a kimvel in a ron tlet. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Cun Saul cu leilung ah a ok ih, “Saul, Saul, zangruangah ka na hrem?” tiah a sinih sipmi aw pakhat a thei.<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Cule Saul nih, “Bawipa, hutu na si?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">“Na hrem ngelngo mi Jesuh ka si. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Hang tho la khawpi sungah lut, cule na tuah ṭulmi cu sip na i thok,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Cun a khualtlotpit pawl cu ṭon ding fiah loin an ding, aw cu an thei nain hutu khaw an hmu lo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saul cu leilung in a hang tho ih a mit a hrak, asinain zangtu khaw a hmu lo. Curuangah a kut in an ṭhi ta ih Damaskas khawpi sungah an fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Ni thum sung cu khua a hmu lo; cuvai ni thum sung cu zangkhaw a ei lo ih ti khaw a ding lo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Damaskas khawpi sungah Ananias tihmi dungthluntu pakhat a um. Langnak sungin Bawipa nih, “Ananias!” tiah a ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Cule ani nih, “Bawipa, hiva ah ka um,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Cun Bawipa nih a sinah, “Hang tho la Zalam Ding tihmi ah feh. Judas inn ah Tarsas khawmi Saul tihmi pa cu hrawl. Ngaihnik, ani cu thla a cam lai berbo; <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />ani khaw langnak a hmu ve ih cuvai langnak sungah Ananias an tihmi pa cu a tiang ih, khua a hmuh thei salnak dingah, a lu cungah a kut a suan cu a hmu,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Cutikah Ananias nih, “Bawipa, mi tamngai sinin hivai pa ih thuhla hi ka fiah cem, Jerusalem ih na mithiang pawl sinah thil ṭha lo tamngai a tuah. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Cun na hmin ko tu pawl hmahhmah tlai dingah puithiam upa pawl ih thuneihnak thawn hiva ah a tiang,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Asinain Bawipa nih a sinah, “Feh! Zangahtihle ani cu Zentail mi pawl, siangpahrang pawl sin le Israel mi pawl sinah ka hmin phurtu ding ka hmanrua ah ka hril cem. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Ka hmin ruangih a tuar dingmi thil tamngai a sinah ka hmuh thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Cule Ananias cu a feh ih inn songah a lut. Saul cungah a kut a suang ih, “Unaupa Saul, hiva na tian lai lampi lakih nang sin a rong langmi Bawipa Jesuh nih, khua na hmuh sal theinak dingah le Thlarau Thianghlim thawn na khahnak dingah na sinah ka na thlah,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Veikhatte ah Saul ih mit sungin ngakep mang a i mi a ṭil ih khua a hmu thei sal. A tho ih baptisma a la. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Cule caw a ei ih thazang a nei sal.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Damaskas Khawpi ah Saul nih Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Cun Saul cu Damaskas khawpi ih dungthluntu pawl sinah ni tawkfang sung a cam. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Veikhatte ah Saul cu sinakok pawl ah a feh ih, Jesuh cu Pathian Fapa a i, tiah thu a sim.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Cule a theitu hmahhmah an mang a bang ngai ih, “Hivai pa cu Jerusalem ih Jesuh hmin a kotu pohpoh a hremtu khi a i lo maw? Cun mi tlai pit in puithiam upa sinih tianpit dingah aiva ah a tiangmi a i lo maw?” tiah an sut fa.<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Asinain Saul ih thusipmi cu huham a nei deuhdeuh, cule Jesuh cu Khrih a i tih a fiangter ih, Damaskas khawpi ih a ummi Judah mi pawl mangbang kau a tuah hnei.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kor 11.32</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref></char>
    </note> Ni tamngai a liam hnukah, Saul cu that dingin Judah mi pawl nih khua an khang. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Asinain Saul nih an khawkhan mi cu a fiah. Saul that dingah a sun a zan in khawpi kotka pawl cu an kil. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Asinain Saul a thluntu pawl nih zan ah an ṭhita, bawm sungah an se ih khawpi kulhnak hruang awng lakin a lengah an hei ṭhum.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem ah Saul A Tiang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Saul cu Jerusalem a tian tikah, dungthluntu pawl kop hnei a tum; asinain dungthluntu a i ve cem tih an zup lo ruangah Saul cu an ṭih. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Asinain Barnabas nih a ṭhita ih forhthlah pawl sinah a fehpit. Cule an sinah Damaskas khawpi fehnak zalam ah Saul nih zangtih in Bawipa a hmu ih, Bawipa nih Saul sinah zangtih in thu a sim tihmi pawl le, Damaskas khawpi ah Jesuh hmin in ralṭha ngai ih thu a sip mi thu pawl cu a simfiang hnei. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Curuangah Saul cu Jerusalem khawpi ih forhthlah pawl sinah lut suak in a um ih ralṭha ngai in Bawipa ih hmin in thu a sim. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Grik ṭon hmang Judah mi pawl sinah thu a sim ih thu khaw an al fa, asinain anni nih Saul cu thah an tum. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Cuvai thu cu zumtu unau pawl nih an theih tikah Saul cu Sisaria khawpi ah an fehpit ih Tarsas khawpi la ah an fehter.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Cutih cun Judea peng, Galilee peng le Samaria peng ih kawhhran pawl cu hnangam ngai in an um ih an pungṭhang deuhdeuh. Thlarau Thianghlim ih thazang peknak le Bawipa ṭihzahnak thawn an nung ih mipum an tam deuhdeuh.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter ih Ṭuanṭuannak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Cun hitih in a si, Peter cu khuazakip ah a tlawn ih Lidda khawpi ih a ummi Bawipa ih mithiang pawl sinah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Cuvai hmunah taksa ze in kum riat sung ihkhun ih a lummi, Aenias tihmi pa cu a hmu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Peter nih a sinah, “Aenias, Jesuh Khrih nih ta damter cem. Hang tho la na tangthah cu zawl,” tiah a ti. Veikhatte ah Aenias cu a hang tho. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Lidda khawpi le Sharon hmunrawn ih a ummi hmahhmah nih Aenias cu an hmu ih Bawipa sin ah an kirsal.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Joppa khua ah Tabitha an tihmi dungthluntu pakhat a um, a Grik hmin cu Dorkas a si ih a sullam cu “Zukneng,” tihnak a i. Cuvai nu cu thil ṭha a tuah ringring ih mi fahrah pawl a bawm ringring. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Cule hitih in a si, cuvai can ah Dorkas cu a fak ih a thi. A ruak cu an ṭawl hnukah cungta khan ah an thlim. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lidda khawpi cu Joppa khawpi thawn a naihfa. Cule dungthluntu pawl nih Peter cu Lidda khawpi ah a um tih an fiah tikah, a sinah mi panih an hei thlah ih, “Thinfahte in, zamrang ngai kan sinah tiang hram,” tiah an sawm. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Curuangah Peter cu a tho ih an sinah a feh. Cule a tian tikah Peter cu cungta khan ah an ṭhi. Nuhmei pawl hmahhmah cu Peter hramah an ding ih an ṭap, Dorkas an sinih a um lai ih a tuahmi kawt angki pawl le a dang hnipuan pawl cu an hmuh. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Peter nih an zatein khan sungin a suakter hnei colh, cule a khuk a bil ih thla a cam. Dorkas ih ruak la tut pitin, “Tabitha, hang tho!” tiah a ti. Dorkas cu a mit a hrak ih Peter a hmuh tikah a hang tho ih a to. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Cun Peter nih Dorkas cu a kut in a awh ih a ding ter; cule Bawipa ih mithiang pawl le nuhmei pawl cu a ko hnei ih nungdam in an sinah a ap hnei. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Cuvai thu cu Joppa khawpi sung hmahhmah ah a thang colh ih, mi tamngai nih Bawipa cu an zum. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Cule hitih in a si, Peter cu Joppa khawpi ah saphaw thawn thil tuahtu Simon inn ah ni reingai a cam.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Kornelias nih Peter A Ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Sisaria khua ah Kornelias tihmi pa a um, ani cu “Italy Ralkap Burpi,” tihmi Rom ralkap uktu ralbawi a i. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kornelias le a innsungsang hmahhmah cu Pathian ngaihsak le ṭihzah tu an i ih mi fahrah pawl bawm ringring tu le Pathian sinah thlacam ringring tu an i. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ni khat cu simla nazi pathum hrawngah Kornelias nih latnak a hmu. Pathian ih vancungmi cu fiangngai in a hmu ih a sinah tiang pitin, “Kornelias,” tiah a ko.<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kornelias nih vancungmi cu ṭih nawn in a zoh ih, “Bawipa, Zangtu a i?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Cule vancungmi nih, “Na thlacamnak pawl le mi fahrah na bopmi pawl cu hmulh lo dingmi thawinak mangin Pathian hmai ah an hang tiang. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Cun a tun ah Joppa khawpi ah Peter tiah kawhmi Simon ko dingin mi thlah hnei. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Cuvai pa cu saphaw thawn thil tuahtu Simon ih inn ah a cam ih a inn cu tipi kapah a um. Ani nih na tuah dingmi ta sim thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Cule vancungmi cu a zuang. Kornelias nih ama kil ringring tu lakih biaknak la taima mi ralkap pakhat, le a sin-um mi panih le cu a ko hnei. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Thil cangmi hmahhmah cu an sinah a sim hnei colh hnukah Joppa khawpi ah a thlah hnei.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />A zingla, khualtlawn in an feh ih Joppa khawpi an phak sam ah, sun dir hrawngah Peter cu thlacam dingin inn cungta khan ah a hang kai. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Peter cu a caw a ṭam ih zangtumaw ei a duh; caw an timtuah lai ah Peter cu latnak a hmu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Cule van cu a hong fa ih a kil pali ih khih mi puan a ṭiah mi thil pakhat leilung ih a ṭhumfa cu a hmu. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Cuvai sungah ke li nei ramsa pawl, leilung ih bokvak ramsa pawl le van ih a hawi mi vate a phunphun an um. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Cule aw pakhat nih a sinah, “Peter, hang tho. That pit in ei,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Asinain Peter nih, “A i lo e, Bawipa! Zangahtihle a thiang lo mi le a borhhlawh mi thil ka ei kel lo,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Cule aw nih a sinah, “Pathian nih a thianter cem mi cu a thiang lo ah ruat hlah,” tiah veinihnak a ti sal. <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Cuvai cu veithum tiang a cang. Cule veikhatte ah puan cu van ah lak kir sal a i.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Cun Peter cu cuvai latnak ih sullam hi zangtu a i tiah a ruah ngelngo laiah, Kornelias ih thlahmi pawl cu Simon ih inn an hrawl ih kotka hmai ah an ding. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Cule an ko ih, cuva ah Peter tih kawhmi Simon a um le um lo an sut.<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Peter cu latnak a hmuhmi a ruah ngelngo laifang ah Thlarau nih a sinah, “Ngaihnik, mi pathum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi pathum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mi hrekkhat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cun, a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mi panih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> nih ta hrawl eng. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Curuangah hang tho pit in rong ṭum. Anma thawn feh dingah zangkhaw ṭhukṭhu hlah; zangahtihle anni cu ka thlahmi an i,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Cun Peter cu a rong ṭum ih an sinah, “Nan hrawlmi cu kei hi ka si. Zangtu thu ruangah nan tiang?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Anni nih, “Ralbawi Kornelias nih kan na thlah. Ani cu mi dingfel le Pathian ṭihzahtu, Judah mi pawl ih upat ngai mi a i. Na ṭonkam pawl ngai dingin a inn ih ta ko dingah a thianghlim vancungmi nih a forh,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Cule Peter nih inn songah a ko hnei ih a riakter hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">A zingla ah Peter cu anni thawn a feh; Joppa khawpi ih zumtu hrekkhat pawl thawn an feh khat. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />A zingla ah Sisaria khawpi an ban ih Kornelias nih a sungkhat pawl le a rualpi ṭha pawl thawn an hngak. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Peter cu inn songih a luh tikah Kornelias nih a hmuak, cule Peter ke hramah a bok ih a be. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Asinain Peter nih a han tho ih, “Hang ding, kei khaw minung ka i ve,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Peter cu cupa be pah in inn songah a lut ih mi tamngai an hmuahkhawm fak cu a hmu. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Peter nih an sinah, “Judah mi nih Zentail mi va len le pawlkop cu kan biaknak daan nih a siang lo tih nan fiah. Asinain hutu khaw mi thiang lo le mi borhhlawh tiah ka tih hnei lo nak dingah Pathian nih ka na hmuh cem. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Curuangah ka na kawh eng tikah nan ta el loin nan sinah ka tiang. Zangtu ruangah ka na ko eng, tih nan ta suh ka duh,” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Cule Kornelias nih, “A liamcia mi ni thum tunmang tikcu simla nazi pathum ah ka inn ah thla ka cam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thla ka cam; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">caw ka ul ih thla ka cam, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> Veikhatte ah mi pakhat cu a tle mi hnipuan hru pit in ka hmaiah a ding ih, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />‘Kornelias, Pathian nih na thlacamnak a thei ih mi fahrah na bopnak pawl khaw a cing colh. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Joppa khawpi ah Peter tiah kawhmi Simon ko dingin mi thlah hnei. Cupa cu saphaw thawn thil tuahtu Simon inn ah a cam ih a inn cu tipi kapah a um,’ tiah ka na ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Curuangah na sinah mi ka thlah lohli; ka na el siang loin na tiang ih ka lungawi tuk. Atun hi Bawipa ih thu ta pekmi thil hmahhmah kan na sip dingmi pawl ngai dingah kan zatein hiva ah Pathian hmai ah kan tiang,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zentail Mi pawl nih Thuthang Ṭha An Thei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Cun Peter cu ṭon a thok ih, “Pathian nih mi thleidan a nei lo tih cu dik ngai in ka fiah. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Zangtumang miphun i khaw sehla Pathian a ṭihzah tu le thil dik a tuahtu pawl cu Pathian nih a cohlang. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Zanghmahhmah tlunih Bawi, Jesuh Khrih thawngin remdaihnak Thuthang Ṭha, Pathian nih Israel mi pawl sinih a phuan mi thu, cu nan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Johan nih baptisma thu a sip hnukah Galilee peng in a thok ih Judea ram sung hmahhmah ah thil maktara a cangmi khaw nan fiah colh. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Nazareth mi Jesuh cu Pathian nih Thlarau Thianghlim le huham thawn zangtih in a thuam tih khaw nan fiah. A sinah Pathian a um ruangah hmunzakip ah feh pit in thil ṭha a tuah ih thlarau sia ih molhmi pawl hmahhmah a dam ter. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Cule Judah mi pawl ih ram sung le Jerusalem khawpi ih a tuahmi hmahhmah a fiahpittu cu kanma hi kan i. Thinglamtah cungah an thlai ih an that. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Asinain a ni thumnak ah Pathian nih thihnak in a thoter sal ih hmuhtheih in a langter. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Mi hmahhmah sinah i loin, Pathian ih a hrilmi a thu fiahpittu le thihnak in a thawhsal hnuk ama thawn a ding ei khat tu kan sin sawn ah a langter. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Cun mi sinah thuthang ṭha sim dingah le hivai pa cu Pathian nih a nungmi le a thimi cungah thuṭhentu ih a tuah mi pa a sihnak thu fiahter dingah kan na forh. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Profet pawl hmahhmah nih ani ih thu an sim ih, ama a zumtu hmahhmah cu a hmin ih huham thawngin sual ngaihthiamnak an co thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zentail Mi nih Thlarau Thianghlim An Co</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Cutih ih Peter a ṭon berbo lai ah, a thu sipmi a ngaitu hmahhmah cungah Thlarau Thianghlim a rong tiang. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Cule Joppa khawpi in Peter thluntu serhtan mi zumtu pawl nih Zentail mi sin khaw ah Pathian nih a laksawng Thlarau Thianghlim a burh tih an hmuh tikah an mang a bang setak. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Zangahtihle cuvai pawl cu ṭon phun dangdang in an ṭon ih maktara Pathian sih zia an thangṭhat cu an theih ruangah a i. Peter nih, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Hivai pawl hi kanma mangin Thlarau Thianghlim an co cem ve. Curuangah ti thawn in baptisma la dingah hutu nih a dawn hnei thei thok?” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Curuangah Peter nih anni pawl cu Jesuh Khrih ih hmin in baptisma la dingah thu a pe. Cule anni nih Peter cu an sinah ni tawkfang cam rih dingin an sawm.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Peter nih A Cangvaihnak A Simfiang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Cun forhthlah pawl le Judea ram sungih a ummi zumtu pawl nih Pathian thu cu Zentail mi pawl khaw nih an pom ve tih an thei. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Cule Peter cu Jerusalem a tian tikah, serhtan mi zumtu pawl nih Peter cu an dokalh ih, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Serhtan lo Zentail pawl inn ah na feh ih an sinah caw na ei,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Asinain Peter nih thil cangmi cu a thok in a sangsang tein a sim hnei:<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Joppa khawpi ih thla ka cam laiah, latnak ka hmu. Puan mang a i mi thil pakhat cu a kil li in an thlai ih van in ka sinah an ron ṭhup cu ka hmu. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ṭhangai in a sung ka zoh ih leilung ih um ke li nei ramsa pawl, sahrang pawl, bokvak ramsa pawl, le van ih a hawi mi vate pawl ka hmu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Cule aw pakhat ka thei ih, ‘Peter, hang tho. That pit in ei,’ tiah ka na ti. <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Asinain kei nih, ‘Bawipa, a i lo! A thiang lo mi le a borhhlawh mi ziangkhaw ka kaa sungah a lut dah kel lo,’ tiah ka ti. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Cule vancung in aw nih, ‘Pathian nih a thiangter cem mi cu thiang lo ah ruat hlah,’ tiah veinihnak ka na ti sal. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Cutih in veithum tiang rori a cang ih netabik ah a zatein van ah lak kir sal a i. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Cu laifang ah Sisaria khawpi in ka sinih an thlah mi, mi pathum cu ka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kan, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> riahnak inn hmai ah an ding. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Cule ṭhukṭhunnak um loin an sinih feh dingah Thlarau nih ka na forh. Hivai Joppa khawmi kan unau minung paruk khaw ka na thlun eng ih Kornelias inn ah kan lut. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kornelias nih a inn ih vancungmi a hmuh thu kan na sim. Vancungmi nih Kornelias sinah, ‘Joppa khawpi ah mi thlah hnei lai cikhaw Peter tiah an kawhmi Simon tihmi pa ko ter hnei. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Ani nih thu nan ta sim thok ih cuvai thu nih nangma le na innsungsang hmahhmah nan ta rundam thok,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Cule thusip ka thawh cangin a hramthok ih kan cungih Thlarau Thianghlim a tian mangin an cung khaw ah a tiang ve. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Forh 1.5</ref></char></note> Cun Bawipa nih, ‘Johan nih cu ti thawn baptisma nan ta pe, asinain nan cu Thlarau Thianghlim thawn baptisma pek nan i thok,’ tiah a sipmi ka cing sal. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Curuangah Bawipa Jesuh Khrih a zumtu kan sinah Pathian nih laksawng kan na pek mangin, Zentail mi pawl sin khaw pek an ih ahcun Pathian ih zalam dawnkham dingah kei cu hutu ka si?” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Cuvai thu an theih tikah an dokalhnak cu an cawlhnga ih Pathian thangṭhat in, “Pathian nih Zentail mi pawl nunnak an co theinak dingah sualsirnak cu an sin khaw ah a pe hnei ve,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok Khua ih Kawhhran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Forh 8.1–4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Stefen thahnak thu ih a suakmi hremnak ruangah a ṭekdarh mi pawl cu Fonisia, Saipras le Antiok khawpi tiang an ban ih Judah mi pawl sin kau ah Thuthang Ṭha cu an phuang. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Asinain cu pawl lakih mi hrekkhat cu Sairin khua le Saipras tikulh mi an i. Cu pawl cu Antiok khawpi tiang an feh ih Bawipa Jesuh ih Thuthang Ṭha cu Zentail<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zentail; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Grik ṭon hmang Judah pawl </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Grik ṭon hmang pawl, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> mi pawl sin khaw ah an sim. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Cun Bawipa ih kut cu an sinah a um ih mi tamngai nih an zum ih Bawipa la ah an herfa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Cuvai thu cu Jerusalem khawpi ih um kawhhran sinah a ban, cule Barnabas cu Antiok khawpi tiang feh dingin an thlah. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Barnabas cu Antiok khawpi a tian tikah Pathian nih mipi pawl thlawsuah a pekzia a hmu ih a lung a awi setak. Cule an thinlung zatein Bawipa an zum ih rinsattlak zumtu an ih theinak dingah thazang a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Zangahtihle Barnabas cu mi ṭha, zupnak le Thlarau Thianghlim thawn a khatmi a i. Cule mi tamngai cu Bawipa sinah a ṭhi hnei.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Cun Barnabas cu Saul hrawl dingah Tarsas khawpi ah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Saul a hmuh tikah Antiok khawpi ah a ṭhita. Cule kum khat sung cuva ih kawhhran thawn an pawlkom fa ih mi tamngai thu an zirh. Cun Antiok khawpi ah dungthluntu pawl cu Khristian tiah kawh hmasabik an i.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Cuvai tikcu hrawngah profet pawl cu Jerusalem in Antiok khawpi ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Forh 21.10</ref></char></note>An lakih mi pakhat, Agabus tihmi pa cu a ding ih, leilung pumpi ah mangṭam maktara a tlung tawn thok, tiah Thlarau ih fiahternak in thu a phuang. Caesar Klaudius nih Rom siangpahrang a ṭuan lai ah cuvai mangṭam cu a tlung. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Dungthluntu pawl cu anma le tihthei zat in Judea ram ih a ummi zumtu unau pawl bopnak pe dingah an tawlrel. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Cule an tawlrel cia mangin an ngahmi tangka cu Barnabas le Saul sin in kawhhran upa sinah an kuat.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">James Thahnak le Peter Thawngthlaknak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Cuvai tikcu hrawngah Siangpahrang Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Siangpahrang Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Palestine ram zate uktu Herod Agrippa I.</char></note> nih kawhhran sungih Khristian hrekkhat pawl hrem a thok. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Cun Johan ih unaupa James cu ralnam thawn a that. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Cuvai nih Judah mi pawl an lung a awiter tih a hmuh ruangah, Peter khaw a tlai ter hnei. Cuvai cu Colh tello Sang Puai tuah laifang a i. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Peter cu an tlai ih thawng ah an thla, cule bur khat ah mipum pali a ummi ralkap bur li sinah an ap. Lantak Puai colh hnukah Peter cu mipi hmai ah suah in a thu rel dingah Herod nih khua a khang. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Curuangah Peter cu thawng ah an thla, asinain kawhhran nih a hrangah cat loin Pathian sinah thla an cam.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter Runsuahnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Peter cu Herod nih a thu rel dingin mipi hmai ih a suah hlan, a nizan ah thawnginn kiltu ralkap panih karlak ah a it. Thirhri panih in an khit ih thawnginn suahka khaw an kil. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Rinlopi in Bawipa ih vancungmi cu a tiang ih meisa nih thawnginn khan sung cu a tlet. Vancungmi nih Peter cu a hnin ih, “Zamrang in hang tho!” tiah a ṭhang. Cule Peter kut ih thirhri pawl cu an poih. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Cun vancungmi nih, “Na taikap kap fa la na kedap khaw hru,” tiah a ti. A tih mangin Peter nih a tuah. Cule vancungmi nih, “Na hnipuan hru la ka thlun,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Peter cu a feh ih vancungmi cu a thlun. Cule vancungmi ih a tuahmi cu thutak ah a ruat lo, latnak ka hmu a i thok tiah a ruat fa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ralkap ih an kilnak a pakhatnak kotka le a panihnak kotka cu an lan ih khawpi sung fehnak thir kotka an ban. Cuvai thir kotka cu an hrangah ama tein a hong fa ih an suak. Cule zalam pakhat an thlun ih rinlopi in vancungmi nih a zuangta hnei.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Cun Peter cu a lung a fim ih, “Herod ih thuneihnak sung le Judah mi pawl nih ka cungih tuah an duhmi hmahhmah lak sungin ka na runsuak dingah, Bawipa nih a vancungmi a ron thlah, tih atun cu ka fiah taktak i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Cule thil cangmi a fiah ngah hnukah Marka an tihmi Johan ih nu Mary ih inn ah a feh; cuva ah mi tamngai an hmuakkhawm fa ih thla an cam deido. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Cun Peter nih suahka a king hnei ih Rhoda tihmi sinum nu cu kotka hong dingin a feh. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Cuvai nu nih Peter ih aw a si tih a fiah tikah a lungawi tuk ih suahka hman hong loin inn songah a lut sal ih, “Suahka hmai ah Peter a ding,” tiah a sim hnei. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Cule anni nih, “Na aa mawh!” tiah an ti. Asinain, a si taktak tiah a tih thotho ruangah, “A vancungmi si lai tu!” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Asinain Peter cu cat loin suahka a king ngelngo. Cule suahka cu an hong ih Peter a si tih an hmuh tikah an khawruah a har. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Daitein um dingah Peter nih a kut a zap hnei, cule Bawipa nih thawnginn sungin a suahnak thuhla cu an sinah a sim hnei. Peter nih, “Hi thu hi James le a dang zumtu pawl sim uh,” tiah a ti hnei. Cun a suak ih hmun dangah a feh.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />A zingla khua a van tikah, Peter cungih thil cangmi thuhla ah ralkap pawl cu an buai setak. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herod nih Peter cu a hrawl nain a hmu lo. Curuangah thawnginn kiltu pawl cu an thu a zingzawi ih that dingin thu a pe hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Cule Herod cu Judea peng in Sisaria khawpi ah a feh. Cuva ah can tawkfang a um.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herod ih Thihnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Cun Herod cu Tai-ar mi pawl le Sidon mi pawl cungah a thin a se ngai. Curuangah cuvai khawmi pawl cu Herod sinah a bur in an feh. A hmasabik ah siangpahrang ih ihnak khan kiltu Blastas cu an sin la ah ṭang dingin an sawm. Cule Herod sinah an feh ih remnak tuah dingin an sut. Zangahtihle an ram mi pawl ih ticaw an ngahnak cu Herod siangpahrang ukmi ram sungta a ih ruangah a si.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />An ni khiahmi ni ah Herod cu a siangpahrang thuam a hru ih a thuṭhennak tokheng cungah to pit in mipi pawl sinah thu a sim. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Cule mipi pawl nih, “Hivai hi pathian ih aw a i, minung ih aw a i lo!” tiah an hek. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Veikhatte ah Bawipa ih vancungmi nih Herod cu a fakter, zangahtihle Herod nih Pathian sinah sunloihnak a pek lo ruangah a si. Cule Herod cu zangrual nih an ei ih a thi.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Asinain Pathian ih thu cu a ṭhang ih a karhzai.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabas le Saul An Thlah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Cule Barnabas le Saul cu an ṭuanṭuan an colh tikah Jerusalem in<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jerusalem in; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jerusalem ah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> an kirsal ih, Marka tihmi Johan cu an sinah an ṭhita.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Antiok khawpi ih kawhhran ah profet pawl le zirhtu pawl cu an um: Cu pawl cu Barnabas, (Midum tih kawhmi) Simeon, (Sairin khawmi) Lucius, (Herod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galilee peng uktu Herod Antipas (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3.1</ref></char> zoh).</char></note> Tetrak thawn a ṭhanglian khat mi) Manaen, le Saul le pawl an si. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Bawipa rian in leh caw ul in an um lai ah, Thlarau Thianghlim nih, “Barnabas le Saul hi ka thiahmi ṭuanṭuan kau ṭuan dingah a dangtein thia uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Cun caw ul in thla an cam ih, Barnabas le Saul ih lu cungah kut an suang hnukah an thlah.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saipras ah Barnabas le Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Cule Thlarau Thianghlim ih thlahsuaknak in, Barnabas le Saul cu Seleusia ah an feh ih cuvai hmun in Saipras tikulh ah lawng thawn an feh. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Salamis khawpi an tian tikah Judah mi pawl ih sinakok ah Pathian thu an sim. Bawmtu dingah Johan Marka khaw an ṭhita.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Cule Saipras tikulh pumpi an feh ih, Pafos khawpi tiang an feh. Cuva ah Judah mi Bar-Jesuh tihmi dawithiam pa profet deu an hmu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Ani cu Saipras tikulh uktu Sergias Paulas thawn an um. Sergias Paulas cu mifing ngai a i. Pathian thu theih a duh ruangah Barnabas le Saul cu a sinah a ko hnei. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Asinain dawithiam Elimas (Elimas tih cu a Grik hmin a i) nih a dodal hnei ih, tikulh uktu Sergias Paulas cu a zupnak in pialter a tum. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Cule Paul tih khaw ih an kawhmi Saul cu Thlarau Thianghlim in a khat ih Elimas cu mit ṭhep lo in a zoh ih, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“Nang Seihtan fapa, dinfelnak hmahhmah ih ral, hrokhrawlnak phun zakip le thuphan ih khat, Bawipa ih zalam ding pawl merhkawi hi na cawlhnga thok lo maw? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Atun ah ngai hnik, Bawipa ih kut cu na cungah a um, na mit a khang thok ih tawkfang sung cu khua hmu lo in na um thok,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Veikhatte ah Elimas cu khawdur le khawmaw nih a ron ṭilh ih a kut in sualtu ding hrawl in a dap ngelngo. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Cule tikulh uktu nih cuvai thil cangmi a hmuh tikah a zum; zangahtihle Bawipa ih thuhla an zirhmi ah a khawruah a har ngai.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidia Ram Antiok Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pafos khawpi in Paul le a rualpi pawl cu lawng thawn an feh ih, Pamfilia ram Perga khawpi an ban. Cuva in Johan Marka nih a ramta hnei ih Jerusalem khawpi ah a kir. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Perga khawpi in an feh ih, Pisidia ram Antiok khawpi an ban. Cun Sabbath ni ah sinakok ah an lut ih an to. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Cule Daan cabu le Profet pawl ih cabu pawl an siar hnukah, sinakok uktu pawl nih, “Unau pawl, mipi pawl hrangah thazang peknak ṭonkam nan neih asihle sim uh,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Cun Paul cu a ding, a kut a zap ih thu a sim,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Pathian a bia tu Zential mi pawl le ka phunpit Israel mi pawl, ka ngai hnik uh! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Israel mi pawl ih Pathian nih kan pupa pawl a hril hnei ih, Izipt ram ah a langte sung an um lai ah, miphun hnemngai ah a tuah hnei. Cule a maktara mi huham thawn cuvai ram in a hruaisuak hnei. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Cun ram ro ram car ah kum sawmli sung a kilkhawi hnei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kilkhawi hnei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">thinsau ngai in a zoh hnei, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Cule Kanan ram ih miphun pasarih pawl a siatsuah colh ih an ram cu ama ih miphun sinah a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Hitih in thil a cangmi hi kum 450 hrawng a rei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Cu hnukah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hitih in thil a cangmi hi kum 450 hrawng a rei. “Cu hnukah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kum 450 hnukah.</char></note> profet Samuel san a tian hlan sung an sinah Thuṭhentu pawl a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Cule Israel mi pawl nih siangpahrang an hler ih Pathian nih kum sawmli sung an siangpahrang si dingah Benjamin hrin Kish ih fapa Saul cu an sinah a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Pathian nih Saul cu a hnong ih David cu an siangpahrang dingah a tuah. David ih thu ah Pathian nih hitih in a ti: ‘Jesse ih fapa David, ka thinlung mang pu mi minung ka hmu cem. Ani nih tuahter ka duhmi hmahhmah a kimter thok,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Cule a thutiam mangin, Pathian nih Israel mi pawl hrangah David cithlah sungin Rundamtu Jesuh a suakter. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3.3</ref></char></note> Jesuh ih ṭuanṭuan a thok hlan ah, Johan nih Israel mi hmahhmah sinah an sual sir fa ding le baptisma co dingah thu a sim. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Joh 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Joh 1.27</ref></char></note> Cule Johan nih a ṭuanṭuan a colh i thok tikah, ‘Kei hi hutu ah ka ruat uh ci? Kei cu a cuvai pa ka si lo. Asinain ngai hnik uh, ka hnukah mi pakhat a tiang, kei cu a kedap phoihtu ding hmanah ka tlak lo,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“U le nau pawl, Abraham ih tesinfa pawl le nan lakih Pathian ṭihzahtu Zentail mi pawl, hivai rundamnak thu hi kan zate sinah kuat a i. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Zangahtihle Jerusalem khawpi ih a ummi pawl le an hruaitu pawl nih Jesuh cu an fiahthiam lo. Sabbath ni cangcang an siarmi profet pawl ih nganmi thu pawl an fiahthiam lo ruangah Jesuh cu daan an tat ih cuvai profet pawl ih ṭonkam cu an kimter. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat 27.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mar 15.13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk 23.21–23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Joh 19.15</ref></char></note> Cule thihnak tlak thu zangkhaw an hmu lo nain, ani cu that dingah Pilat sin an hler. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57–61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42–47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joh 19.38–42</ref></char></note> Cun a thuhla an ngan cia mi pawl hmahhmah an tuah colh hnukah thinglamtah cungin an ṭhum ih thlan ah an phum. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Asinain Pathian nih thihnak in a thoter sal ih, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Forh 1.3</ref></char></note> ama Jesuh thawn Galilee peng in Jerusalem khawpi tiang khual a tlawntu pawl sinah ni tamngai sung a lang. Atun ah cuvai pawl cu Israel mi pawl sinah fiahpittu an i. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33" />Cule kan pupa pawl sinah Pathian ih thutiam cu nan sinah kan phuang. Jesuh thawhter salnak thawgin an tesinfa kan sinah cuvai thutiam cu Pathian nih a famkim ter. Cuvai cu Saam panihnak sungah:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:32-33">“ ‘Nang cu ka Fapa na si,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:32-33">nihin ni ah na Pa ka si i cem,’ tiah nganmi mangin a i.<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Cun Jesuh ih ruak cu a ṭawtciam lonak dingah, Pathian nih mithi lak in a thoter. Cucu hitih in a sim cia:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘David sinih ka tiamkammi a thianghlim ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">rinsantlak a i mi thlawsuah pawl cu nan ta pe thok,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Curuangah a dang Saam sung khaw ah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Na mi thianghlim cu a ṭawtciam men ding na siang thok lo,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Zangahtihle David cu ama ih san sungah Pathian duhmi ṭuan a ṭuan ih a thih tikah a pupa pawl sinah phum a i, cule a ruak cu a ṭawtciam ta. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Asinain Pathian ih a thawhter salmi Jesuh cu a ṭawtciam lo. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />Curuangah ka phunpit pawl, hivai hi fiah uh, Jesuh thawngin sual ngaihthiamnak thu cu nan sinah phuan a i; cule Moses daan nih nan ta luatter thei lo, asinain Jesuh a zumtu hmahhmah cu sual hmahhmah sungin luatter an i. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />A tangla mangin Profet pawl nih an sipmi hi nan cungah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nan cungah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tihmi a um lo.</char></note> a tian pang lonak dingah ralring uh. Profet pawl cunih:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Zoh hnik uh, nan mi nautat hmang pawl! Mangbang thinphang uhla riaral uh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Zangahtihle nihin ni ih ka tuahmi hi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">mi nih nan sinah an simfiang hmanah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">nan zup duh lo dingmi a i,’ ” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paul le Barnabas cu sinakok in an suah cangka ah mipi pawl nih hmaizarh Sabbath ni khaw thu sim sal dingin an sawm. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Sinakok ih mipi pumkhawmnak an colh i tikah, Judah mi tamngai le Judah biaknak ih a lutmi Zentail mi tamngai nih Paul le Barnabas cu an thlun. Paul le Barnabas nih an sinah thu an sim ih, Pathian thinfahnak sungah nung reuhro dingin an forh.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />A hmaizarh Sabbath ni ah an khawpawh deuhthaw in Bawipa ih thu ngai dingah an tiang. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Judah mi pawl cu mipi tamngai an hmuh tikah nahsuahnak in an khat. Paul ih thusipmi pawl cu dokalh in ṭonkam sia an ṭon. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Cutikah Paul le Barnabas nih ralṭha ngai in, “Nan sinah Pathian thu sip hmasak cu a ṭul hrimhirm. Asinain nannih nan el ih nanma le nanma kumkhua nunnak co tlakih nan ruahfak lo ruangah, ngai hnik uh, Zentail mi pawl sinah ka her fa thok. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Zangahtihle Bawipa ih thu kan na pek mi cu hitih in a si:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“ ‘Leilung ne tiang rundamnak kengtu dingah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">nan cu Zentail mi hrangah tleunak ah nan ta tuah cem,’ a ti,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Zentail pawl nih cuvai thu an theih tikah an lung a awi ngai ih, Bawipa ih thu cu an sunloih. Cule kumkhua nunnak co dingah Pathian ih a hrilmi pawl nih an zum.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Cule Bawipa ih thu cu ram pumpuluk ah a darh. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Asinain Judah mi pawl nih Pathian a betu numi pawl le khaw sungih hruaitu pami pawl cu an tokhrolh. Cule cuvai pawl nih Paul le Barnabas cu an hrem ih an peng sungin an dawi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar 6.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk 9.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10.11</ref></char></note>Paul le Barnabas cu an ke ih leivut an thingta ih, Ikoniam khawpi la ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Cule dungthluntu pawl cu Thlarau Thianghlim le lungawinak thawn an khat.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Ikoniam Khawpi ah Paul le Barnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Cun hitih in a i, Ikoniam khawpi ah Paul le Barnabas cu Judah mi pawl ih sinakok ah an lut ih thu an sim. Cule Judah mi tamngai le Grik mi tamngai nih an zum. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Asinain a zum duh lo tu Judah mi pawl nih Zentail pawl an tokhrolh ih zumtu unau pawl cungah thinlung sia nei kau an tuah. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Curuangah Paul le Barnabas cu cuva ah reingai an cam ih ralṭha ngai in Bawipa ih thu cu an phuang. Bawipa ih thinfahnak thu an phuanmi a dik ti ih nemhngetnak ah hmuhsaknak pawl le mangbangza pawl tuah theinak cu pek an i. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Asinain khaw sung mipi pawl cu an ṭhen fa colh. Mihrek nih Judah mi an ṭan ih mihrek nih forhthlah pawl an ṭan.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Cule Judah mi pawl le Zentail mi pawl cu an hruaitu pawl thawn forhthlah pawl hmualphoter ding le lung in nam dingah thu an relcat. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Cuvai cu forhthlah pawl nih an fiah tikah Likaonia ram Listra khawpi, Derbe khawpi le a kiangkap ram ah an zuang. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Cule cuva ah Thuthang Ṭha cu an phuang.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Listra le Derbe Khawpi ah Paul le Barnabas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Cun Listra khua ah a ke ṭhalo mi pa pakhat cu a to. Ani cu a suahkeh in keze a i ih veikhat khaw a feh dah kel lo. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Cupa nih Paul ih thusip cu a ngai. Cule Paul nih cuvai pa cu mit ṭhep loin a zoh ih dam dingah zupnak a nei tih a hmuh tikah, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />aw thang ngai in, “Ding ngai in hang ding!” tiah a ti. Cule cuvai pa cu a han sawsokfa ih a feh. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mipi pawl nih Paul ih thil tuahmi an hmuh tikah, an hek ih, Likaonia ṭon in, “Khawzing pathian pawl cu minung mangah cang in kan sinah an rong ṭum silai tu!” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Barnabas cu Zeus tiah hmin an sak ih Paul cu thusimtu bik a sih ruangah Hermes tiah an ko. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Zeus ih biakinn cu an khawhnar lengah a um, Zeus pathian ih puithiam nih cawtum le pangpar pawl cu kotka ah a tianpit, zangahtihle mipi pawl thawn forhthlah pawl sinah raithawinak pek an duh ruangah a si.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Cuvai thu cu forhthlah Barnabas le Paul nih an theih tikah an hnipuan an phat fa ih mipi lakah hek pah in an zuang. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />Cule, “Zangruangah hivai thil hi nan tuah? Kan khaw nan mangin minung menmen kan i ve. A ṭhahnem lomi himang thil nan tuah nakin lei le van, tifingriat le a sungih ummi hmahhmah a tuahtu Pathian nung sinih nan kirhsalnak dingah, kan cu nan sinah Thuthang Ṭha nan ta sim. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Hlanlai ah cun Pathian nih miphun hmahhmah anma an duhmi zalam feh dingin a sian hnei. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Asinain thil ṭha a tuah mi nih ama le ama minung sinah phuangfa loin a um kel lo. Van in a zuah a zu ter ih anma le tikcu teah thlairah pawl nan ta pe. Cule ticaw khopkhamnak le lungawi-diriamnak thawn nan thinlung cu a khatter,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Cuvai thu pawl an sim na hratin an sinih raithawi lo dingah mipi pawl cu harsa ngai in an dawn thei fangfang.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Cun Judah mi hrekkhat pawl cu Antiok le Ikoniam khawpi in an tiang ih mipi pawl cu an la ah ṭang dingin an sawm hnukah, Paul cu lung in an nam. A thi cem ah an ruat ih khaw lengah an dukta. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Asinain dungthluntu pawl a hramih an pumkhawm fak lai ah Paul cu a tho ih khaw sungah a feh sal. A zingthlala ah Barnabas thawn Derbe khawpi ah an feh.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siria Ram Antiok Khawpi ah An Kir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Cule Paul le Barnabas cu Derbe khawpi ah Thuthang Ṭha an sim ih, dungthluntu tamngai an ngah. Cuhnukah Listra, Ikoniam khawpi le Pisidia ram Antiok khawpi ah an kir sal. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Dungthluntu pawl cu thinlung thazang an pe ih zupnak sungah rinsattlak ngai in um dingah an forh. “Pathian Uknak sungih a luttu ding kan pawl cu harsatnak tamngai hmuak ding hrimhrim kan i,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Cun kawhhran cangcang ah kawhhran upa an hril sak ta ih cawul in thla an cam hnukah, zumtu pawl cu Bawipa sinah an ap ta.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Pisidia ram an lat hnukah Pamfilia ram an tiang. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Perga khua ah Thuthang Ṭha an sip hnukah Attalia khawpi la ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Cuva in Antiok khawpi ah lawng thawn an feh. Antiok khawpi cu ṭuan an ṭuan colh cemmi ṭuan dingah Pathian thinfahnak in an apfak tadahnak hmun a i.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Antiok an tian tikah kawhhran mipi pawl an ko khawm ih, Pathian nih a hman hnei zia le Zentail mi pawl sinah zupnak suahka a hon sak hnei zia pawl an sim. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Cuva ah dungthluntu pawl thawn reipi an um khat.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Khonsil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Judea peng in mi hrekkhat pawl cu Antiok khawpi ah an tiang ih, “Moses Daan mangin serh nan tan lo ahcun rundam nan i thei thok lo,” tiah zumtu unau pawl cu an zirh. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Paul le Barnabas nih cuvai thu cu rauh ngai in an el. Cule cuvai thu thawn pehpar in forhthlah pawl le kawhhran upa pawl thawn hmuak fa dingin Jerusalem ih feh dingah Paul, Barnabas le zumtu dang hrekkhat pawl cu an forh.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Cun an pok ih kawhhran pawl nih an thlah. Cule Fonisia ram le Samaria ram an pal pah ih Zentail mi pawl zangtih mangin an lung an thleng fa tihmi thu an sim pah riahro. Cuvai thu an theih tikah zumtu unau pawl cu an lungawi setak. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Jerusalem an phak tikah, forhthlah pawl, kawhhran upa le kawhhran pawl nih an hmuak. Cule anma hmangin Pathian ih a tuahmi thil hmahhmah cu an sim. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Asinain Farasi pawl lakih a telmi zumtu hrekkhat pawl cu an ding ih, “Zentail mi pawl cu serh an tan tengteng a ṭul ih, Moses Daan thlun dingin kan forh a ṭul,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Cule cuvai thu ruat dingah forhthlah pawl le kawhhran upa pawl cu an hmuakkhawm fa. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Forh 10.1–43</ref></char></note> Reinawn an relkhawm hnukah, Peter cu a dingih an sinah, “U le nau pawl, Zentail mi pawl nih Thuthang Ṭha an thei ih an zup theinak dingah aihlan deuh ah Pathian nih nan lakin kei hi ka na hril tih cu nan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">Forh 10.44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:4">2.4</ref></char></note> Cule thinlung fiahtu Pathian nih Zentail mi pawl a cohlang hnei ih kan sinih Thlarau Thianghlim kan na pek mangin an sin khaw ah Thlarau Thianghlim a pekhneinak thawngin a cohlan hnei nak a langter. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Pathian nih Zentail mi le kan karlakah thleidannak a nei lo, zangahtihle zupnak thawngin an thinlung cu a thiangfaiter cem. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Curuangah kanma le kan pupa pawl ih kan phurh thei lomi kawn cu zumtu pawl ih liang ah phurter pit in zangruangah Pathian cu nan hneksak? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Asilo! Bawi Jesuh ih thinfahnak thawngin rundam kan ih mangin, Zentail mi pawl khaw rundam an i ve, tih hi kan zum,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Cun mipi hmahhmah cu daitein an um ih, Paul le Barnabas nih anma hmangin Pathian nih Zentail mi pawl sinah mangbangza le hmuhsaknak a tuahmi pawl hmahhmah an sipmi cu an ngai. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />An sip colh hnukah, James cu a ding ih, “U le nau pawl, ka ngai hnik uh! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Pathian nih ama hmin hrangah Zentail mi pawl lakin minung hrekkhat pawl la dingah hmasabik a vehvaih hneinak thu cu Simon nih a sim cem. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Cuvai thu cu Profet pawl ih thu thawn a ṭiah fa. Ca Thianghlim nih:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“ ‘Hi hnukah ka kirsal thok ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">A ok cem mi David ih biakbuk cu ka sa sal thok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">A siat cem mi cu ka sa sal thok ih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">ka tungding sal thok.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Cutih in a tangrih mi minung pawl le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">ka hmin ih ka hrilmi Zentail mi pawl hman nih Bawipa an ko thok.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Khuahlan lai in hivai thu a fiahtertu Bawipa nih a ti,’ tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Curuangah Pathian la ih a hoitu Zentail mi pawl hi hnaihnok hlah lausing tih hi ka ruahdan cu a si. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Cunakin milem biaknak ticaw thianglo ei lo ding, nupa sualnak tuah lo ding, hngawngrek ih thahmi sa le sathi pawl hrial dingin ca kuat sawn lausing. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Zangahtihle Sabbath ni cangcang sinakok ah Moses Daan cu kum reingai sung siar cem a i ih khawpi cangcang khaw ah phuan cem a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zentail Zumtu pawl sinih Khonsil Cakuat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Cun forhthlah pawl, kawhhran upa pawl le kawhhran zaten anma sungin mi hrekkhat hril pit in Paul le Barnabas thawn Antiok khawpi ih thlah dingah thu an ṭhencat. Zumtu pawl lakih hruaitu Barsabbas tih kawhmi Judas le Silas cu an hril. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />A tangla ih cakuat thawn an thlah:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Nan unau a i mi, forhthlah pawl le kawhhran upa pawl nih, Antiok, Siria le Silisia ih Zentail zumtu pawl, cibai na ta buk. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Kan sinin mi hrekkhat pawl nan sinah an tiang ih an ṭonkam nih buainak nan ta pe ih, nan thinlung a hnaihnok tih kan fiah. Hihi kan forhmi an si lo. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Curuangah kanma lakin mi hrekkhat hril pit in kan duhdawt ngaimi Paul le Barnabas thawn nan sinih thlah dingah thu kan ṭhencat. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Paul le Barnabas cu kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih ih hmin hrangah an nunnak tiang a pe ngamtu an i. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Curuangah Judas le Silas cu anni sinah kan thlah ih anni nih kan cakuat nganmi cu nan ta sim eng thok. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Thlarau Thianghlim le kan cu nih atangla ih thil ṭulmi pawl hrello thilrit dang nan ta phurhter lo ding cu, thil ṭha ah kan ruat: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Milem biaknak ticaw, sathi, hngawngrek ih thah mi sa, le nupa sualnak pawl cu hrial uh. Hivai thil pawl nan hrial thei ahcun a ṭha colh thok. Fimdamte in um hram uh,” tiah an ngan.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Cun Judas le Silai cu an thlah ih Antiok khua ah an feh. Cule mipi pawl an ko khawm ih cakuat cu an pe. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Cuvai ca an siar tikah mipi pawl cu an lung a awi ngai, zangahtihle thapeknak ca a sih ruangah a i. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Judas le Silas cu profet an ih mangin zumtu unau pawl sinah thu tamngai sim in an hnem ih tha an pe. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Cuva ah tawkfang an cam hnukah zumtu unau pawl nih hnangamte in an thlah ih anma thlahtu kawhhran sinah an kir sal. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" pubnumber="[34]" sid="ACT 15:34" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 34: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Asinain Silas cu cuva ah a tangta, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paul le Barnabas cu Antiok ah an um rih, midang tamngai thawn Bawipa ih thu cu an zirh ih an phuang.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul le Barnabas An Ṭhen Fa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Cun ni tawkfang hnukah Paul nih Barnabas sinah, “Bawipa ih thu kan sipcia nak khua cangcang ah fehsal pit in zumtu unau pawl zang an ṭiah tih va zoh sal sing,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnabas nih Marka tih an kawhmi Johan khaw ṭhittak a duh. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Forh 13.13</ref></char></note> Asinain Paul nih Johan Marka ṭhittak ding cu rem a ti lo, zangahtihle Johan Marka nih ṭuanṭuannak ah thlun hnei loin Pamfilia ram in a tluntak hnei dah ruangah a si. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Cun Paul le Barnabas karlak ah thu alfaknak cu a luar deuhdeuh ih pakhat le pakhat an ṭhen fa. Barnabas nih Johan Marka cu a ṭhita ih lawng thawn Saipras tikulh ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Cun zumtu unau pawl nih Paul cu Bawipa ih thinfahnak sungah an ap, cule Paul nih Silas cu a hril ih an feh. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Cun Paul le Silas cu Siria ram le Silisia ram an pal pah ih kawhhran pawl tha an pe riahro.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timote nih Paul le Silas A Thlun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Cun Paul cu Derbe le Listra khawpi ah a ban. Cuva ah Timote tihmi dungthluntu pakhat a um. A nu cu Judah mi a i ih zumtu a i. A pa cu Grik mi a i. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timote cu Listra le Ikoniam khawpi ih zumtu unau pawl nih an lop ngaimi a i. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paul nih Timote cu a khualtlotnak ah ṭhittak a duh. Curuangah a serh a tanter, zangahtihle cuva ih a ummi Judah mi pawl nih Timote ih pa cu Grik mi a i tih an fiah ruangah a si. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Khua cangcang in an tlawn pah riahro ih, Jerusalem khawpi ih forhthlah pawl le kawhhran upa pawl nih an relcatmi daan pawl cu thlun dingin an sim. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Curuangah kawhhran pawl cu zupnak ah an cak deuhdeuh ih ni cangin an karh.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masidonia Kawhnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Paul le a rualpi pawl cu Frizia ram le Kalatia ram ah an feh. Zangahtihle Thlarau Thianghlim nih Asia ram sungih Thuthang Ṭha sip ding cu a kham hnei. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Misia ramri an tian tikah, Bithinia ram sungah luh an tum, asinain Jesuh ih Thlarau nih a sian hnei lo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Curuangah Misia ram cu pal pah in<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pal pah in; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lole </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lan in.</char></note> Troas khawpi ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Cun zanah Paul nih latnak a hmu ih Masidonia mi pakhat cu dingin, “Masidonia ram ah kan pha la kan bawm hram” tiah a hler. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paul nih latnak a hmuh colh hnukah, Masidonia ram ih feh dingin kan tim kan tuah lohli, an sinih Thuthang Ṭha sim dingin Pathian nih kan na ko tiah kan ruat.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipi ah Lydia Lungthlennak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Cun Troas khawpi in lawng thawn dingte in Samothrace tikulh ah kan feh; cule a zingthlala ah Neapolis khawpi kan ban. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Cuva in Masidonia ram peng pakhat ih khaw thupi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Masidonia ram peng pakhat ih khaw thupi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Masidonia ram peng pakhatnak ih khawpi, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Masidonia ram peng pakhat ih khawpibik, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> Rom ih ukmi khua, Filipi khawpi ah kan feh. Cuva ah ni tawkfang kan cam. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Sabbath ni ah khawpi kotka in tivakap ah kan feh ih cuva ah Judah mi pawl thlacamnak hmun a um thok tiah kan ruat. Kan to ih cuva ih a tiangmi numi pawl thawn thu kan ruah fa. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />An lakih mi pakhat, kan thu ngai tu cu puan sendup zuartu le Pathian a betu Thiatira khawmi Lydia tihmi nu a si. Paul ih thusipmi pawl ṭhangai in ngai dingah Bawipa nih a thinlung cu a hon sak. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Cule ama le a innsang zate in baptisma an co colh hnukah, “Bawipa ah mi rinum tiah ka na ruah eng asihle ka inn ah tiangin ka cam ve hram uh,” tiah kan na sawm. Hramhram in kan na sawm.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thawnginn sungah Paul le Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Cun hitih in a i, thlacamnak hmun ih kan feh laiah, khawse molhmi hmala thu a sim cia theitu sal nu pakhat nih kan na pha. Hmala thu a sipcianak ruangah a bawi pawl hrangah tangka tamngai a ngah. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Cuvai nu nih Paul le kan cu kan na thlun ih, “Hi pawl hi nan sinah rundamnak lampi a phuangtu, Cungnung Bik Pathian ih sal an si!” tiah a hek. <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Cutih in ni tamngai a tuah. Paul cu a thin a se setak ih a dungla herfa pin khawsia sinah, “Hi nu sungin suak dingah Jesuh Khrih hmin in thu ta pe,” tiah a ti. Culai fang rori ah khawsia cu a suak.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Asinain a bawi pawl nih an ruahsan mi hlawknak a um i lo tih an hmuh tikah, Paul le Silas cu an tlai. Cule dawr hmunah thuneitu pawl sin an dukta. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Cun Rom uktu pawl sinah an fehpit ih, “Hi pawl hi Judah mi an i ih kan khawpi sungah buainak an suakter. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Kan Rom mi pawl ih cohlan dingah le thlun ding daan thawn a kalh fa mi nunphung pawl an zirh,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Cule mipi pawl khaw Paul le Silas an dokalh ve.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Rom uktu pawl nih an hnipuan an phoih sak ih fung thawn thawi dingin thu an pe. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Vei tamngai an thawi hnukah thawnginn sungah an khum ih thawnginn kiltu pa cu ṭhangai kil dingin thu an pe. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Cuvai thupek a don hnukah, Paul le Silas cu thawnginn sungta khan ah a khum hnei ih an ke ah hreng a sut.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Zanṭim hrawngah Paul le Silas cu thla an cam ih Pathian thangṭhatnak hla an sa. Cule thawngtla dang pawl nih an ngai. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Rinlopi ah rauh ngai in ling a hnin ih thawnginn innkil lung pawl an hnin colh. Cule veikhatte ah suahka pawl an hongfa colh ih thawngtla an khihnak thirhri pawl cu a poih colh. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Cun thawnginn kiltu cu a hang ṭhang ih suahka pawl hongfa colh in a hmu. Cutikah thawngtla pawl an zuang colh cem ah a ruat, cule a namte a zuk ih ama le ma thahfak a tum. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Asinain Paul nih a aw neih patawp in a hek ih, “Nangma le nangma tuahmawh fa hlah! Zangahtihle kan zatein hiva ah kan um colh kau,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Cule meisa a hler hnei ih thawnginn sungah a lut, ṭih le ṭhia pah in Paul le Silas hmai ah a bok. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Cun lengah a ṭhita hnei ih, “Ka bawipa le pawl, rundammi i dingah zangtu ka tuah thok?” tiah a sut hnei.<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Anni nih, “Bawi Jesuh zum la nangma le na innsang in rundam nan i thok,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Cun Bawipa ih thu cu ama le a innsang zate sinah an sim. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Cuvai zan rori ah Paul le Silas cu a ṭhita hnei ih an hmeihma pawl cu a tuamhlawm sak hnei. Cule veikhatte ah ama le a innsang zatein baptisma an co. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Cun Paul le Silas cu a inn ah a ṭhi hnei ih an hmai ah caw a hlut hnei. Ama le a innsang zatein Pathian an zup ruangah lungawinak in an khat.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Cule khua a van tikah, Rom uktu pawl nih palik bawi pawl an thlah ih, “Anni le khi thlah uh,” tiah thu an pe.<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Cun thawnginn kiltu pa nih Paul sinah, “Rom uktu pawl nih nang le Silas thlah dingin thu an pe cem. Curuangah atun hi nan suak thei, hnangamte in feh uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Asinain Paul nih palik bawi pawl sinah, “Rom mi kan i ve kau nain mawhlo cingin mipi hmai ah kan na thawi ih thawnginn sungah kan na hlon. Cule atun ah a thuptein kan na thlah nan tum maw? A cang thei lo! Rom uktu anma rori tiang pit in kan suah seu,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Cun palik bawi pawl nih cuvai thu cu Rom uktu pawl sinah an sim. Cule Paul le Silas cu Rom mi an i, tih an fiah tikah an ṭih. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Cun an feh ih ngaihthiam an dil. Thawnginn sungin an suah hnukah khaw sung in suak dingin an hler. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paul le Silas cu thawnginn sungin an suah hnukah, Lydia ih inn ah an lut. Cuva ah zumtu unau pawl nih an pha ih tha an pe, cule khaw sungin an suak.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Thesalonika Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paul le Silas cu Amfipolis le Apollonia khawpi an pal pah ih Judah mi pawl ih sinakok umnak Thesalonika khawpi ah an tlawn. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />A tuahkel mangin Paul cu sinakok ah a feh. Cule Sabbath ni nithum sung Ca Thianghlim sungih thu pawl an relkhat ih, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Khrih cu thihnak a tuar tengteng a ṭul ih thihnak in a thawhsal tengteng a ṭul tih cu Ca Thianghlim hmangin a langter ih a simfiang hnei. “Nan sinih ka phuanmi Jesuh hi Khrih cu a si,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Cule mi hrekkhat nih an zum ih Paul le Silas an kop. Cumangin Pathian ṭihzahtu Grik mi tamngai le numi hruaitu pawl khaw Paul le Silas sinah an kop ve.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Asinain Judah mi hrekkhat pawl nih an nahsuah. Curuangah dawr hmun in mi ṭhalo pawl cu an ko ih miburpi ah an cang. Cule khaw pumpuluk ah buainak tuah an thok. Cun mipi hmai ih suahpit dingah Jason ih inn cu an luhhnawh ih Paul le Silas cu an hrawl. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Asinain Paul le Silas cu an hmuh lo tikah Jason le zumtu unau hrekkhat pawl cu khaw uktu bawi pawl sinah an fehpit ih, “Leilung linglettu pawl cu atun kan sinah an tiang. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Anni cu Jason nih a cohlang hnei. Cule siangpahrang dang a um, a hmin cu Jesuh a si, tiah an ti ih an zatein Caesar ih thusuahmi pawl cu an dokalh,” tiah an hek caimco. <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Cutih ih an heh cu mipi pawl le khaw uktu bawi pawl nih an theih tikah an buai colh. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Cule Jason le a rualpi pawl cu thlah dingah a ṭul zat tangka an pe ter ih an thlah sal.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Berea Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Cuvai zan ah zumtu unau pawl nih Paul le Silas cu Berea khawpi ah an thlah lohli. Berea khawpi an bat tikah Judah mi pawl ih sinakok ah an feh. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Berea khua ih Judah mi pawl cu Thesalonika khua ih Judah mi pawl nakin an thinlung a ṭha sawn. An thusipmi pawl cu hlawptlo ngai in an cohlang ih, Paul ih thusipmi cu a dik maw dik lo tiah ni cangcang in Ca Thianghlim thawn an zohṭhim. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Curuangah mi tamngai nih an zum; upat tlak Grik numi pawl le Grik pami tamngai khaw nih an zum ve. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Asinain Thesalonika khawpi ih Judah mi pawl nih, Paul nih Berea khawpi khaw ah Pathian thu a sim, tih an theih tikah Berea khawpi ah an feh ih mipi pawl cu an tokhrok ih an buaiter. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Cun zumtu unau pawl nih veikhatte ah Paul cu tifingriat la ah feh dingin an thlah; asinain Silas le Timote cu Berea khawpi ah an tangta. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Paul cu a thlahtu zumtu unau pawl nih Athens khawpi tiang an thlun; cule a thluntu pawl cu, a rang thei bikin Silas le Timote cu a sinah tiang dingin thu a cah hnei ih an kirsal.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Athens Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paul nih Silas le Timote cu Athens khawpi in a hngah hnei lai ah, cuvai khawpi cu milem in a khat tih a hmuh tikah a thinlung a fak ngai. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Judah mi pawl le Pathian ṭihzahtu Grik mi pawl thawn sinakok ah thu an al fa hlan; dawr hmun ih a tiang tu pawl thawn khaw ni cangcang thu an al fa reuhro. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Epikurian thuzirhtu hrekkhat le Stoik thuzirhtu hrekkhat pawl thawn khaw thu an al fa. Mi hrekkhat nih, “Hivai mi tlokciar pa hi zangtu thu sip a tum?” tiah an ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Midang pawl nih, “Ram dang pathian pawl ih thuhla a sim sirua,” tiah an ti. Zangahtihle Paul nih an sinah Jesuh le thawhsalnak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jesuh le thawhsalnak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grik ca ih ṭon nu a i mi, “thawhsalnak” tihmi hi khawzing nu pakhat ih hmin tiah ruah a theih.</char></note> thu a sip ruangah a si. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Curuangah Paul cu Areopagas tihmi an khua ih khonsil sinah an suahpit; cule, “Na sipmi zirhnak thar hi zangtu a i, tih fiah kan duh. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Zangahtihle ruahnak danglam kan na sim ih a sullam fiah kan duh,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Zangahtihle Athens mi zate le cuvai hmun ih ram dang mi pawl cu an tikcu zate hmangin thu thar cu theih berbo le sip berbo a duh bikmi pawl an i.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Cule Paul cu an khua khonsil Areopagas hmaiah a ding ih an sinah, “Nan Athens minung pawl, biaknak la ah nan taima ngai tih ka fiah. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Zangahtihle nan khawpi sungih ka toihvah tikah Pathian nan biaknak hmin pawl khaw ka zoh ih biakṭheng pakhat cungah, ‘Fiah Lomi Pathian Sinah,’ tiah nan nganmi ka hmu. Cutih ih nan fiah lo nain nan biakmi Pathian cu atun nan sinih kan phuanmi cu a si. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:48">Forh 7.48</ref></char></note>Cuvai Pathian cu nih leilung le a sungih ummi hmahhmah hi a sersiam. Ani cu lei le van ih Bawi a ih ruangah minung kut ih sakmi biakinn sungah a um lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Cuvai Pathian cu mi hmahhmah sinah nunnak, thaw le thil dang hmahhmah pawl petu a sih ruangah ṭulsammi nei mangin minung nih a hrangah kan tuahsak ṭulmi zangkhaw a um lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Minung pakhat sungin leilung miphun hmahhmah a tuah ih leilung pumpuluk ah a umter colh. Khawtik can ah an um thok ih khoitu hmun tiang an um thok, tih khaw a hlan khan in a ruatcia colh. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Zangah hitih in a tawlrel cia tihle, Pathian an hrawl ih an hmuh suak theinak dingah a i. Asinain taktakte in tihle Pathian cu kan lakih hutu thawn khaw an hlatfa lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Mi pakhat nih a sip cia mangin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“ ‘Ama ih sungah kan nung, kan cangvai ih kan um!’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">tiah nan hla phuaktu mi hrekkhat nih an tih mangin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Kan khaw hi a tefa kan si ve.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Cutih in Pathian ih tefa kan sih ruangah Pathian ih sihnak cu minung ih thiamnak le ruahnak ih tuahmi sui milem, ngun milem le lung milem thawn ṭiahfa in kan ruah ding a i lo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Hlan lai ah Pathian an fiah lo lai can pawl cu hmu lo mangin a umsan hnei men; asinain atun ah cun khawkakip ih mi hmahhmah cu an lung thleng dingin thu a pe. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Zangahtihle a hrilcia mi pa hmangin leilung pumpuluk hi dik ngai ih thu a ṭhen ding ni cu a khiah cem. Cuvai thu cu thudik a i tiah mi hmahhhmah sinih latternak ah cuvai pa cu thihnak in a thoter sal cem,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Mithi thawhsalnak thu an theih tikah mi hrekkhat nih an zohsuam, asinain mi dang pawl nih, “Hivai thu hi na sinin ngai sal kan duh,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Cule Paul cu an sinin a feh. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Mi hrekkhat nih an thlun ih an zum. A zumtu lakah Khonsil Areopagas sungtel pakhat Dionisias khaw a tel. Damaris tihmi numi pakhat le mi dang pawl khaw an tel ve.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Korin Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Cu hnukah, Paul cu Athens khawpi a suahsan ih Korin khawpi ah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Cuva ah Pontas ram ih a suakmi Judah mi Aquila tihmi pa a hmu. Aquila cu a nupi Priscilla thawn tun naite ah Italy ram in a zuangmi an i. Zangahtihle Caesar Klaudius nih Judah mi hmahhmah cu Rom khawpi in a dawi hnei ruangah a si. Paul cu an sinah a feh ih, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />anni khaw Paul mangin puanthlam ṭhit mi an ih ve ruangah Paul cu an sinah a um ih ṭuan a ṭuan. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Cule Paul cu Sabbath ni cangcang sinakok ah thu a ruah hnei ih, Judah mi pawl le Grik mi pawl cu zum thei dingin sipfiang a tum.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silas le Timote cu Masidonia ram in an tian tikah, Paul cu a tikcu neihmi hmahhmah in Pathian thu sipnak ah a hmang ih Jesuh cu Khrih a i tiah Judah mi sinah a sim. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Asinain Paul cu an dokalh ih an relsiat tikah, Paul nih a lungkim lonak latternak ah a hnipuan cu a thing ih an sinah, “Nan thisen cu nanma nan lu cungah ṭil seh! Kei cu ka thiang. Atun in cu Zentail mi pawl sinah ka feh i thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Cule Paul cu sinakok in a suak ih Titius Justus tihmi pa ih inn ah a lut. Titius Justus cu Pathian betu a i ih a inn cu sinakok hramte ah a um. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Cun Sinakok uktu Krispas le a innsang zatein Bawipa cu an zum. Cule Korin khawmi tamngai khaw nih Pathian thu an thei ih an zum ve. Curuangah baptisma an co.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Zan ah Paul cu latnak a hmu ih cuvai latnak sungin Bawipa nih, “Paul, ṭih hlah, Sim pehzom kau, daitein um hlah, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />zangahtihle na sinah ka um. Hukhaw nih harnak ta pe eng thok lo, zangahtihle hivai khua ah minung tamngai ka nei,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Cule Paul cu cuva ah kum khat le thla ruk a um ih an sinah Pathian thu a zirh.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Gallio nih Akhaia peng a uk laiah, Korin khawpi ih Judah mi pawl nih Paul cu an dokalh ih thuṭhennak zung ah an fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Cule anni nih, “Hi pa nih daan kalh in Pathian be dingah mipi pawl a lem hnei,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Cun Paul cu a ṭon thok fangah Gallio nih Judah mi pawl sinah, “Nan Judah mi pawl, thil ṭha lo tuah le thil sual tuah ruangah i sehla cu nan thu nan ta ngai ding hi a muimawi ngai kau. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Asinain ṭonfang pawl, hmin pawl le nan daan thuhla ih thusuhnak a ih ahcun nanma tein relcat uh. Cumang thuṭhentu sih ka zuam lo,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Cule thuṭhennak zung in Judah mi pawl cu a dawi hnei. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Cun mipi pawl nih sinakok uktu Sosthenes cu an tlai ih thuṭhennak zung hmai ah an thawi. Asinain Gallio nih zangkhaw ah a siar lo.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiok ah A Kir sal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Cun Paul cu Korin khawpi ah can tawkfang a um. Cule zumtu unau pawl cu a ramta hnei ih Priscilla le Aquila thawn Siria ah lawng in an feh. Thukamnak a tuah mangin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Thukamnak a tuah mangin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hivai hi Judah daan ah thukamnak ka thlun tih langternak ah an lu an kolhmi a sipduhnak a i.</char></note> Kenkhria khawpi ah a lu a kolh fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Cule Efesa khawpi an ban ih cuva ah Priscilla le Aquila cu a ramta hnei. Sinakok ah a lut ih Judah mi pawl thawn thu an ruah fa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Judah mi pawl nih an sinah rei deuh cam dingin an sawm nain a lung a kim lo. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Asinain cibai a buk ta hnei ih an sinah, “Pathian nih rem a tih le nan sinah ka tiangsal leh thok,” tiah a ti hnei. Cule Efesa khawpi in lawng thawn a feh.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Sisaria khawpi a tian tikah Jerusalem khawpi ah a hang ih kawhhran cibai a buk, cule Antiok ah a rong kir. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Cuva ah can tawkfang a um hnukah a pok sal ih Kalatia le Frizia ram a tlawn ih dungthluntu pawl hmahhmah cu an thazang a hngetkhoh ter hnei.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efesa le Korin Khawpi ah Apollos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Cule Alexandria khawpi ih suak, Judah mi pakhat Apollos tihmi pa cu Efesa khawpi ah a tiang. Ani cu ṭonkam nal ngai le Ca Thianghlim khaw fiah ngai tu a i. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ani cu Bawipa ih zalam thuhla zirh cemmi a i ih thinlung ih duh taktaknak thawn Jesuh ih thu cu dik ngai in a sim ih a zirh. Asinain a fiahmi cu Johan ih baptisma thu kau hi a si. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Cule sinakok ah ralṭha ngai in thusip a thok. A thusipmi cu Priscilla le Aquila nih an theih tikah an inn ah an sawm ih Pathian ih zalam thuhla cu felfai sinsin in an simfiang. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Cule Apollos cu Akhaia peng ih feh a tum ruangah Efesa khawpi ih zumtu unau pawl nih an bawm ih Akhaia peng ih dungthluntu pawl sinah Apollos an cohlan theinak dingah ca an ngansak. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Zangahtihle zapi hmai ih thu alfaknak ah, Apollos nih Judah mi pawl sinah Jesuh cu Khrih a si tiah Ca Thianghlim hmangin a fiangter ih a neh hnei ringirng.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Efesa Khawpi ah Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Cun hitih in a i, Korin khawpi ih Apollos a um lai ah, Paul cu cuvai ram sungah khual a tlawn ih Efesa khawpi ah a ban. Cava ah dungthluntu hrekkhat pawl a hmu hnei ih, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Paul nih an sinah, “Zumtu nan sih tikah Thlarau Thianghlim ngah u cim?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Anni nih, “Thlarau Thianghlim a um le um lo hman kan fiah lo,” tiah an let.<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Cule Paul nih an sinah, “Asihle zangtu baptisma maw nan co?” tiah a sut hnei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Anni nih, “Johan ih Baptisma,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1.4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk 3.4</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Joh 1.26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char>
    </note> Cutikah Paul nih, “Johan ih pekmi baptisma cu sualsirnak baptisma a i. Johan nih ka dungih a tiang dingmi pa cu zum uh tiah a ti, cucu Jesuh hi a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Cuvai thu an theih tikah, Bawi Jesuh hmin in baptisma an co. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paul nih an cungah a kut a suang ih, an sinah Thlarau Thianghlim a rong ṭum. Cule ṭon phun dangdang in an ṭon ih profet thuphuan in thu an phuang. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />An zatein pacang hleinih hrawng an i.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Cun Paul cu sinakok ah a feh ih thla thum sung ralṭha ngai in thu a sim. Pathian Uknak thu an rel khat ih zum thei dingin a simfiang hnei. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Asinain mi hrekkhat cu an thinlung a ruh tukih an zum duh lo; curuangah miburpi hmai ah Bawipa ih Zalam thuhla cu zohsuam in an rel. Curuangah Paul nih a zuangta hnei ih dungthluntu pawl khaw a ṭhita hnei. Cule Tirannas ih thuzirhnak inn ah ni cangcang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mawla nazi 11:00 in simla nazi 4:00 tiang, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be.</char></note> thu a zirh hnei. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Cun hitih in a i, kum nih sung a ṭuan ih Asia ram sungih a ummi Judah mi iseh, Zentail mi iseh, an zatein Bawipa ih thu cu an thei.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Skeva ih Fapa pawl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Cun Pathian nih Paul hmangin mangbangza thil hleice pawl a tuah. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />A ṭaval le a taingerh puan pawl hman mifak pawl sinih an ken tikah an fahnak a dam ih an sungin khawsia pawl an suak. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Hmunkakip ah vak pit in khawsia a dawitu Judah mi hrekkhat nih Bawi Jesuh hmin in Paul mangih tuah ve an tum. Anni nih khawsia pawl sinah, “Paul ih a sipmi Jesuh ih hmin in nan ta dawi,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Judah mi Puithiam upa Skeva tihmi pa ih fapa, unau pasarih nih cumangin an tuah ve.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Asinain khawsia nih a let hnei ih an sinah, “Jesuh cu ka fiah, Paul khaw ka fiah, asinain nan cu hutu le nan i?” tiah a ti hnei.<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Cun khawsia luhhnawhmi pa nih unau pasarih pawl cu a vel hnei ih a neh hnei colh. Curuangah an hnipuan a pat colh ih hmaliam pi thawn cuvai inn in an zuang. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Cuvai thuhla cu Efesa khawpi ih a ummi Judah mi le Zentail mi hmahhmah nih an theih tikah an ṭih setak ih Bawi Jesuh hmin cu an thangṭhat. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Zumtu lakin mi tamngai an tiang ih an tuahsual mi pawl an phuang ih mi zapi hmuhhngan ah an thuthup pawl an phorh. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Mitkher thiam mi tamngai khaw nih an mitkher cabu pawl an keng ih mi zapi hmuhhngan ah an hul. Cuvai an hul mi an mitkher cabu pawl cu a man an kop tikah ngun tangka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ngun tangka: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngun tangka tihmi cu cuvai lai ah mi pakhat ih ni khat hlawh a i (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mat 20.2</ref></char> zoh).</char></note> 50,000 a i. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Cutih in Bawipa ih thu cu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cutih in Bawipa ih thu cu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Cun Bawipa ih huham cahnak thawngin, thu cu.</char></note> huham cahnak in a ṭhang ih hmun kakip ah a karhzai.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efesa Khawpi ih Buainak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Hih thil pawl a can colh hnukah Paul cu Masidonia peng le Akhaia peng tlawn ta pit in Jerusalem ih feh dingah a thinlung in a tum.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a thinlung in a tum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Thlarau ih hruainak in a ṭhencat.</char></note> “Cuva ih ka tian hnukah, Rom khawpi khaw ka feh tengteng a ṭul,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Curuangah ama bawmtu lakih panih Timote le Erastas cu Masidonia ah a thlah hnei ih ama cu Asia ram sungah can tawkfang a umta.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Cuvai can hrawngah Bawipa ih Zalam thuhla ah buainak hnemngai a suak. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Ngun ih so tuahtu Demetrias tihmi pa nih Artemis khawzing nu ih biakinn zuklem cu ngun in a tuah ih zungthiam pawl cu hlawknak tamngai a pe. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Cun cu pawl le anma mang ṭuanṭuantu dangpawl cu a kokhawm hnei ih an sinah, “Unau pawl, hih ṭuanṭuannak ruangah kan neinung tih cu nan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Cule Efesa khawpi le Asia ram pumpi deuhthaw ah Paul nih mi tamngai a lem hnei ih a hruai sual hnei tih cu nan hmu ih nan fiah. Ani nih, minung kut ih tuahcop mi pathian pawl cu pathian an i lo, tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Cun kan sumtuahnak hi a hmin a se thok tih hi phan a um kau lawng i loin, Asia ram le leilung cung khawkakip ih an biakmi Artemis khawzing nu ih biakinn khaw hi nautat a i thok ih a maktaratnak pawl khaw hi siatsuah a i pang thok tih hi phan a um,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Cuvai cu mipi nih an theih tikah, an thin a se setak ih, “Efesa khawmi pawl ih Artemis cu a maktara setak,” tiah an hek. <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Cun khaw sung cu buainak in a khat. Cule Paul ih khualtlotpit Masidonia mi Kaias le Aristarkas cu an tlai ih puai zohnak bualrawn ah an suahpit. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paul cu mipi hmai ah suah a duh nain dungthluntu pawl nih an sian lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Cun Asia ram ih thuneitu pawl lakih a rualpi hrekkhat khaw nih cuvai puai zohnak bualrawn ah feh hrimhrim lo dingin thu an cah. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mipi lakin buainak a um ruangah, mi hrekkhat nih thu pakhat an hek ih mi hrekkhat nih thu dang an hek ve; mi hrekkhat cu zangruangah kan pumkhawm fa tih hman an fiah lo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Judah mi pawl nih Alexander cu hmai ah suakter pit in buainak thu simfiang dingah an ngen. Cun Alexander nih daitein um dingah mipi pawl cu a kut a zap ih ama le ma humfak a tum. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Asinain Alexander cu Judah mi a i tih an fiah tikah, “Efesa khawmi pawl ih Artemis cu a maktara taktak,” tiah nazi panih sung hrawng an hek.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Cule cuvai khua ih cazi pa nih mipi pawl cu a daiter hnei ih an sinah, “Efesa khawmi pawl, Efesa khawpi cu a maktara mi Artemis khawzing nu ih biakinn le van in a rong ṭil mi milem kilkhawitu a i tih a fiah lotu hutu a um? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Hivai thil pawl cu el theih pawl a i lo. Curuangah daite in um uhla ruatta hmasak loin zangkhaw tuah hlah uh. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Zangahtihle anni pawl cu biakinn siatsuahtu an i lo ih, kan khawzing nu khaw an relsiat lo nain, hiva ah nan suahpit. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Curuangah Demetrias le a rualpi zungthiam pawl nih mi pakhat khat sual mawhpuh ding an neih a sih ahcun thuṭhennak zung cu hon a i. Cuva ah thuṭhentu khaw an um kau ruangah pakhat le pakhat sual puhfa seu. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Asinain thu rel duhmi dang nan neih asihle daan mangin mipi thurelnak hmun ah relcat thok a i. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Zangahtihle nihin ni ih thil cangmi ruangah buainak nan suahpit tiah kan na mawhthluk pang thok tih phan a um. Hivai buainak thu ah puhmawh ding kan nei lo, zangahtihle a duhsatnak rel ding zangkhaw kan nei lo,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Cuti ih a tih hnukah mipi thurelnak cu a cawlhngater.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Masidonia le Akhaia Ram ah Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Cun buainak a net hnukah, Paul nih dungthluntu pawl cu a ko hnei ih tha a pe hnei. Cule cibai a buk hnei ih Masidonia ram ah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Cuvai ram cu a tlawn ih thapeknak awkam tamngai a sim hnei. Cule Grik ram ah a ban ih, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />cuva ah thla thum sung a cam. Cun Siria ram la ih lawng thawn a pawh tum fangah Judah mi pawl nih ani dokalh in a thupte in thil ṭha lo an ruah ruangah, Masidonia ram la in kirsal dingah thu a ṭhencat. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Cule Berea khawmi Pirhas ih fapa Sopater, Thesalonika khawmi Aristarkas le Sekundas, Derbe khawmi Kaias, Asia rammi Taikhikas le Trofimas, leh Timote pawl nih Paul cu an fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Cuvai pawl cu an feh khan ih Troas khawpi in kan na hngah eng. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Colh tello Sang Puai a net hnukah Filipi khawpi in lawng thawn kan feh, ni nga hnukah Troas khawpi ah kan man ih cuva ah ni sarih sung kan cam.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih Troas Khawpi Neta Bik A Tlotnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Nipi ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nipi ni; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Niruk ni.</char></note> simla ah, zanriah ei khat dingin kan hmuakkhawm fa. Paul cu a zingthlala ah feh thok a ih ruangah an sinah zanvar thu a sim hnei. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Kan hmuahkhawm faknak cungta khan ah mei-inn tamngai a um. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Cule Zutikhas an tihmi tlangval pakhat Paul ih thu a sip berbo laiah cu tukvirh ah a to ih a ihhmul. A ihhmulh titngai lai ah inn ṭhat thumnak in leilung ah a rong ṭil. An rong sar tikah cu a thi cem. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Paul cu a rong ṭum ih tlangval pa ih cungah a bok ih a pom. Cule, “Nan thinphang hlah uh, a nung rih,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Cule Paul cu cungta khan ah a hang kai sal ih sang a ṭhen ih an ei. Paul cu zingla nisuak tiang thu a sip hnukah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Tlangval pa cu nungdam in inn ah an fehpit ih an hna a ngam ngai.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Troas in Miletas ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Cun Assos khawpi ah lawng thawn kan feh ih, cuva ah Paul sawm pah thok kan i; zangahtihle ama ih khawkhan cia mangin ke thawn feh khan a tum. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Cule Assos khawpi ah Paul cu kan hmu ih, lawng cungah kan ṭhi ih Mitilene khawpi ah kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Mitilene khawpi in lawng thawn kan feh ih a zingthlala ah Khios tikulh ral khatla kan ban. A tipsun ah Samos tikulh kan ban ih a thiamsun ah Miletas khawpi kan ban. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paul nih Asia ram ih cam rei ding cu a duh lo ruangah lawng thawn Efesa khawpi cu lat a tum; zangahtihle a canthiam ah cun Pentikos ni khel in Jerusalem ih tian lohli a duh.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efesa Kawhhran Upa pawl sinah Paul ih Neta Bik Thucahmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Paul nih Miletas khawpi in Efesa khawpi ah mi a thlah ih, kawhhran upa pawl a ko hnei. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Kawhhran upa pawl an tian tikah an sinah, “Asia ram kan tiang ih a ni khatnak in ka tikcu hmahhmah cu nan sinah zangti mangin ka hmang tih cu nan fiah colh kau. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Judah mi pawl ih bawhthupnak ruangah a cangmi hneksaknak pawl le tangdor ngai le mitthli tamngai pawl thawn Bawipa cu ka rian. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Zapi hmai ah iseh, inn khat hnuk inn khat ah iseh, nan hrangih a ṭhahnem mi zangkhaw sup loin thu nan ta sim ih nan ta zirh tih khaw nan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Judah mi sinah iseh, Zentail mi pawl sinah iseh, an sual sir in Pathian la ah kir dingin leh kan Bawipa Jesuh zum dingin fakngai in thu ka sim. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Cule atun ah ngai hnik uh, Thlarau Thianghlim ih hruainak mangin Jerusalem khawpi ah feh ka tum; cuva ah ka cungah zangmang thil a cang thok tih ka fiah lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Khawpi cangcang in thawngtlaknak le harsat-hremnak hlanghlang nih ka na bawh tiah Thlarau Thianghlim ih ralrin peknak hlang kau hi ka fiahsun cu a si. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Tim 4.7</ref></char></note>Asinain ka hrangah ka nunnak hi zangkhaw ah ka siar lo; Bawipa Jesuh nih ṭuan dingin ka na pekmi Pathian ih thinfahnak Thuthang Ṭha phuansuah ding ṭuanvo hi ka colh hluhsuah thei ding kau hi ka saduhthah a i.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Cun ngai hnik uh, Pathian uknak thu sim in nan lakah ka vak. Asinain atun cu hukhaw nih ka hmel nan hmu sal i thok lo, tih ka fiah. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Curuangah mi hmahhmah ih thisen lakin kei cu ka thiang tiah nihin sun ah nan ta fiahter. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Zangahtihle Pathian ih tumtahmi hmahhmah cu sup loin nan sinah ka phuang. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Nanma le nanma kilkhawi fa uhla, Thlarau Thianghlim nih tuurual pawl kilkhawi dingin nan ta tuah mangin nan tuurual pawl cu ṭhate in kilkhawi uh. Pathian<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bawipa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> nih a Fapa thisen thawn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">a Fapa thisen thawn; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">a Fapa ih thihnak thawngin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Amah ih thisen thawn.</char></note> ama ta ih a tuah cemmi a kawhhran khaltu i hram uh. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nan ta fehtak hnukah ṭihnungza sase pawl an tiang thokih tuurual pawl hi an zuah thok lo, tih ka fiah. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Nanma sung rori khaw in, dungthluntu pawl anma la ih hruaisual dingah thuphan simtu an suak thok. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Curuangah ralring uh. Sun le zan cawlhnga loin mitthli thawn kum thum sung nan ta zirhmi pawl khi hmulh hlah uh.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Atun cu Pathian sinah le a thinfahnak thu sungah nan ta ap cem. Ama nih nan ta tungding thok ih mithiang pawl ih co dingmi ro khaw nan ta pe thok. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Sui iseh, ngun iseh, hnipuan khaw iseh hutu ih ta khaw ka daw hnei lo. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Keima le ka rualpi ih ṭulsammi pawl hmahhmah cu hivai ka kut nih a ṭuan tih cu nan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Santlai lo pawl nan bop theinak dingah himang ṭuanṭuan har ṭuan in zanghmahhmah nan ta hmuh cem. Bawipa Jesuh nih, ‘Ngah la nakin pek la ah thlawsuah a tamsawn,’ tiah a tihmi a ṭonkam pawl khi cing ringring uh,” tiah thu a cah hnei.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Cule Paul nih cutih in thu a sip colh hnukah a khuk a bil ih an zatein thla an cam. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Cun an zatein an ṭap, Paul cu an bua ih an hnam. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Hutukhaw nih ka na hmu sal eng i thok lo tiah a tihmi nih an reh a se ter cuangce. Cule lawng umnak tiang an hei thla.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Khawpi ah Paul A Feh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Cun hitih in a si, kan na thlatu pawl kan ramtak hnukah ding ngai in kan feh ih, Kos tikulh kan tiang. A zingthlala ah Rhodes tikulh in Patara khawpi ah kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Cuva ah Fonisia peng ih a feh dingmi lawng kan hmu, cuvai lawng cu kan to ih kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Saipras tikulh a latnak hmun kan tiang ih cuva in thlangla ah kan her ih Siria ram la ah kan thulh. Cule Tai-ar khawpi ah kan ṭum, zangahtihle cuva ah lawng ih thil phurhmi pawl ṭhilh thok a i. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Cule cuva ah dungthluntu pawl kan hmu ih an sinah ni sarih kan cam. Thlarau ih sipnak in cuva ih dungthluntu pawl nih Paul cu Jerusalem khawpi ah feh lo dingin an dawn. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kan sihkhat can a ne i ih kan suak ih kan feh. Cule dungthluntu pawl nih an nupi le fale pawl thawn khaw leng tiang kan na thlah eng. Cun tikap ah kan khuk kan bil ih thla kan cam. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Pakhat le pakhat cibai kan buk fa ih lawng cungah kan kai, cule anni khaw an inn ah an tlung.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Cun Tai-ar khawpi in lawng thawn kan feh ih Ptolemais khawpi ah kan tiang, cuva ah zumtu unau pawl kan hmu ih an sinah ni khat kan cam. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Forh 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8.5</ref> </char></note> A zingthlala ah kan pok sal ih Sisaria khawpi ah kan tiang. Cuva ah Jerusalem khawpi ih upa pasarih hrilmi lakih pakhat a i mi Pathian thu simtu Filip ih inn ah kan cam. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Filip nih profet thuphuan ih thuphuangtu lengfa him fanu pali a nei. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Forh 11.28</ref></char></note> Ni tawkfang kan cam hnukah, Judea ram in profet pakhat Agabus tihmi pa a tiang. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Kan sinah tiang pit in Paul ih taikap cu a la ih a kut le ke a khit fa, cule, “Thlarau Thianghlim nih hitih in a ti: Hivai taikap neitu pa hi Jerusalem khawpi ah Judah mi pawl nih an khit thok ih Zentail mi pawl ih kut ah an ap thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Cuvai thu kan theih tikah kanma le cuva hmun ih a ummi pawl nih, Paul cu Jerusalem khawpi ih feh lo dingin kan ngen deido. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Cule Paul nih, “Zangah nan ṭap ih ka thinlung nan kuai ter? Bawipa Jesuh ih hmin ruangah cun Jerusalem khawpi ih thawngtlak kau i lo, thih hman ka tiari fa,” tiah kan na let.<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Kan dawn thei lo ruangah daitein kan um ih, “Bawipa ih duhdan mangin i kau seh,” tiah kan ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Cuvai hnukah kan tim kan tuah ih, Jerusalem khawpi ah kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Sisaria khawpi ih a ummi dungthluntu hrekkhat pawl nih kan na thlun eng ve ih kan riahnak ding Mnason ih inn ah kan na ṭhi eng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kan riahnak ding Mnason ih inn ah kan na ṭhi eng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kan riahnak ding inn neitu Mnason thawn an tiang.</char></note> — Mnason cu Saipras tikulhmi a i ih dungthluntu hmasa pawl lakih pakhat a i.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih James A Leng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Jerusalem khawpi kan tian tikah, zumtu unau pawl nih lungawi ngai in kan na hmuak. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />A zingthlala ah Paul thawn kan zatein James sinah kan feh ih cuva ah kawhhran upa pawl khaw an um. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paul nih cibai a buk hnei ih, an ṭuanṭuannak ah Pathian nih Zentail pawl lakih a thil tuahmi pawl pakhat hnuk pakhat a simfiang hnei. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Cule cuvai thu an theih tikah Pathian an thangṭhat. Cun anni nih Paul sinah, “Kan unaupa Paul, Judah mi pawl sungin mi thawng tamngai cu zumtu ah an cang cem ih Daan an thlunnak ah zangtlukin taimak an suah tih cu na hmu. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Zentail ram sungih a ummi Judah mi hmahhmah sinah Moses Daan dungtut dingin le an fale pawl cu serhtan lo dingin le Judah daan pawl thlun lo dingin na zirh hnei tiah hiva ih ummi pawl nih thu an thei. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Zangtih in kan tuah thok? Mipi pawl nih hiva na tian hi an fiah thok ih kan sinah an tiang thok. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Curuangah ta sip mangin tuah lai ci. Hiva kan sinah thukamnak a tuah cemtu mi pali an um. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Anni cu ṭhita hnei la anma thawn thianfai fa uh, cule an sam vawhnak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">an sam vawhnak: </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:18">18.18</ref></char> zoh.</char></note> man khaw peksak hnei. Cutih in na thuhla an theihmi cu a dik lo tihmi mi hmahhmah nih an fiah thok ih Daan na thlun ih Daan mangin na nung tihmi an fiah thok. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Forh 15.29</ref></char></note> Zentail mi zumtu pawl thuhla ah cun himang thil pawl hi tuah lo dingin ca kan kuat cem. Anni cu milem sinih pekmi ticaw ei lo ding, sathi ei lo ding, hngawngrek ih thahmi sa ei lo ding, leh nupa sualnak tuah lo ding, tiah kan relcat,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Curuangah a zingthlala ah Paul nih cuvai mi pali cu a ṭhita hnei ih an thianfai fa. Cule Biakinn sungah a lut ih thianfainak ni hi khawtikah a ne thok ih khawtik mangah an pakhat fingfing hrangah thawinak pek thok a i, tihmi a sim.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biakinn sungah Paul An Tlai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ni sarih a net i thok tikah Asia ram ih a tiang mi Judah mi hrekkhat pawl nih Paul cu Biakinn sungah an hmu. Cule mipi pawl cu an tokhrolh ih Paul cu an tlai. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />An hek ih, “Israel mi pawl kan bawm uh! Hivai pa nih kan mipi pawl iseh, Moses Daan iseh, hivai Biakinn iseh dokalh in hmunzakip ah mi hmahhmah thu a zirh. Cu hlei ah Zentail mi pawl khaw Biakinn sungah a tianpit hnei ih hivai hmun thianghlim hi a borhhlawh ter,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Forh 20.4</ref></char></note> Cutih ih an hehnak san cu Efesa khawmi Trofimas khi Jerusalem khawpi ah Paul thawn an hmu ih, Paul nih Biakinn sungah a luhpit, tih ih an ruah ruangah a si.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Cuvai thu nih khawpi sung cu buainak in a khatter, cule misenpi pawl cu an tiang deido ih Paul cu an tlai. Cun Biakinn kulh sungin an duk ih kotka pawl cu an khar lohli. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Mipi pawl nih Paul cu thah an tum lai ah, Jerusalem khaw pumpi cu a buai tiah Rom ralkap hotu ralbawipi sinah, thu an than. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Veikhatte ah cuvai ralbawipi cu ralbawi dang pawl le ralkap pawl thawn mipi sinah an va zuang cih. Mipi pawl nih cuvai ralbawi pa le ralkap pawl an hmuh tikah, Paul an thawi lai cu an cawlhnga. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Cun ralbawipi cu a feh ih Paul cu a tlai, cule thirhri panih thawn khit dingah thu a pe. Cun hivai pa hi hutu a si ih zangtu a tuah tadah, tiah a sut hnei. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Cule mipi sungin mi hrekkhat nih phun khat in an hek ih, mi hrekkhat nih phun dang in an hek. Thawngvang a tamtuk ruangah thufiang a thei thei lo ih Paul cu ralkap ṭankulh sungah fehpit dingin thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Mipi pawl an buai tuk ruangah Paul cu likkha a tian tikah ralkap pawl nih a zot in an zawn. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Mipi pawl nih an dungla in an thlun ih, “That uh!” tiah an hek pah riangro.<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih A Humfaknak Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Cun Paul cu ralkap ṭankulh sungih an fehpit laifang ah ralbawipi sinah, “Na sinah thu ta sim thei na ing im?” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Ralbawipi nih, “Grik ṭon na thiam maw? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Kan dung ral a thawh lai ih hriamnam thawn ramṭhing ah mi 4,000 a zuanpittu Izipt pa khi na si maw?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Asinain Paul nih, “Kei cu Judah mi ka i. Silisia ram Tarsas khawpi ih a suakmi, khawpi hminthang ih um ka i. Mipi pawl sinah thusipnak can ka pe hram,” tiah a hler.<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ralbawipi sinin thusip theinak khuan a ngah hnukah, Paul cu likkha cungah a dingih mipi pawl cu daitein um dingah a kut a zap. Mipi pawl an daih tikah Paul nih Hebru ṭon in an sinah thu a sim.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Cun Paul nih, “U le nau, nu le pa pawl, atun nan sinih ka humfaknak thu ka sipmi hi ngai hnik uh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />An sinah Hebru ṭon in thu a sip an theih tikah an dai ṭhipṭhep.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:2">Cule Paul nih: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Forh 5.34–39</ref></char></note>“Kei cu Silisia peng Tarsas khawpi ih suak Judah mi ka i. Asinain Jerusalem khawpi ah ka ṭhanglian ih Gamaliel ih zirhmi ka i. Kan pupa pawl ih daan cu famkim ngai ih zirhmi ka i. Nihin ni ah hivai hmun ih a tiangmi nan mangin Pathian sinah pum petu ka i tadah ve. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.4,5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Forh 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9–11</ref></char></note>Bawipa ih zalam thluntu pawl cu thi tiangin ka hrem hnei. Numi tilo, pami tilo in ka tlai hnei ih thawng ka thla hnei. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Cun Puithiam Lubik le Khonsil upa pawl cu cuvai thu ah ka na fiahpittu an i. Damaskas khawpi ih unau pawl sin pek ding ca cu cuvai upa pawl sinah ka la. Cule Bawipa ih zalam thluntu pawl cu tlai hnei ding le Jerusalem khawpi ah ṭhi hnei pit in cawhkuan pe hnei dingah Damaskas khawpi ah cu ka feh.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih A Lungthlennak Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Forhthlah 9.1–19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Cule hitih in a i, sun lai hrawng Damaskas khua ka tian sam fangah, veikhatte ah vancung in a tle ngaimi tleunak nih ka kimvel cu a ron tlet. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Leilung ah ka ok ih aw pakhat nih, ‘Saul, Saul! zangruangah ka na hrem?’ tiah ka na tih cu ka thei. <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />‘Hutu na si, Bawipa?’ tiah ka sut ih ani nih, ‘Na hrem ngelngo mi Nazareth mi Jesuh ka si,’ tiah ka na let. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ka rualpi pawl nih meisa tle cu an hmu nain ka na biatu ih aw cu an thei lo. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Cun kei nih, ‘Bawipa, zangtu ka tuah thok?’ tiah ka sut. Cule Bawipa nih, ‘Hang tho la Damaskas khawpi ah feh. Cuva ah na tuah dingih ka ruah cia mi thil hmahhmah ta sim eng thok,’ tiah ka na ti. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Cule cuvai meisa cu a tle tuk lawmlam ih khua ka hmu thei lo. Cun ka rualpi pawl nih ka kut in ka na sualta ih Damaskas khawpi sungah ka na fehpit.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Cun cuva ah Ananias an tihmi pa cu ka sinah a tiang. Ani cu daan mangin Pathian ngaihsakmi le cuvai khua ih Judah mi pawl hmahhmah ih upatmi a i. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ananias cu ka hramah a ding ih ka sinah, ‘Unaupa Saul, khua hmu sal,’ tiah ka na ti. Cuvai can rori ah khua ka hmu sal ih ama cu ka han zoh. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Cule ani nih, ‘Kan pupa pawl ih Pathian nih ama ih duhnak fiahtu dingah le Mi Dingfel Pa hmu dingah le a kaa ih a aw thei dingah ta hril cem. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Zangahtihle nang cu mi hmahhmah sinah na hmuhmi hmahhmah le na theihmi hmahhmah fiahpittu na i thok. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Atun ah zangtu na hngah ngelngo? Hang tho la Bawipa ih hmin ko pah in baptisma co la na sual pawl thiangter,’ tiah ka na ti.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zentail Mi sinah Thu Sim dingin Paul Kawhnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Cule hitih in a si, Jerusalem ih ka kirhsal hnukah, Biakinn sungih thla ka cam lai ah langnak ka hmu ih, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />cuvai latnak ah Bawipa cu ka hmu. Bawipa nih, ‘Hriam vengvo, Jerusalem in suak lohli, zangahtihle hivai khawmi pawl nih ka thuhla na phuanmi an pom thok lo,’ tiah ka na ti. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Cun kei nih, ‘Bawipa, sinakok ah ka feh ih ta zumtu pawl thawng ka thlak hnei leh ka thawi hnei cu anma rori nih an fiah. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Forh 7.58</ref></char></note>Cule na thufiahpittu Stefen ih thisen an suah lai ah, kei khaw an hramte ah ka ding. An thah cu ka lung a kim ih, a thattu pawl ih hnipuan ka kilsak hnei,’ tiah ka ti. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Cun Bawipa nih ka sinah, ‘Feh kau, zangahtihle lam hlatpi ih Zentail pawl sinah ta ka thlah thok,’ tiah ka na ti,” tiah Paul nih a sim.<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Cuvai thu a sip tiang cu mipi pawl nih an ngai. Cule an aw neih patawp an suah ih, “Cuvai pa cu leilung in hlon uh, zangahtihle nung tlak a i lo!” tiah an hek. <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Cun hek pah in an hnipuan an hlon ih zil lakah leivut cu an theh ciamco. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Rom ralbawipi nih Paul cu ṭankulh sungih fehpit dingin thu a pe. Mipi pawl nih zangruangah hitih mangin an heh tih fiah dingah fung thawn thawi dingin le thu sut dingin a forh hnei. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Cun fung thawn thawi dingin saphaw hri thawn an khih laiah, cuva ih a dingmi ralbawi pa cu Paul nih, “A sual thu ṭhensak rih lo Rom mi pakhat thawi cu daan thawn a kaihfa maw?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ralbawi pa nih cuvai thu a theih tikah ralbawi pi sinah a feh ih, “Zangtu na tuah? Hivai pa hi Rom mi a i sangkhaw!” tiah a sim.<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Cule ralbawipi cu Paul sinah a feh ih, “Rom mi na i maw? Ka sim hnik aw,” tiah a sut.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Hngi, Rom mi ka i,” tiah Paul nih a let.<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ralbawipi nih, “Kei khaw Rom mi sihnak dingah tangka tamngai ka pe ve,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Cule Paul nih, “Kei cu ka suahkeh in Rom mi ka i,” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Cule vetein Paul thusuh le thawi a tumtu pawl cu dungah an sip colh. Ralbawipi khaw nih Paul cu Rom mi a i tih le Rom mi pakhat hri thawn a khih tih a fiahfak tikah a thin a phang ngai.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khonsil hmaiah Paul An Tianpit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ralbawipi nih, Judah mi pawl nih Paul cungah sual an puhmi hi zangruangah a si, tih thudik a fiah duh ruangah a zingthlala ah Paul cu a suah ih Puithiam upa pawl le Khonsil upa zatein hmuakkhawm fa dingin thu a pe. Cule Paul cu a ṭhi ih an hmala ah a dingter.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Cun Paul nih Khonsil upa pawl cu hmaiton in a zoh hnei ih, “Ka phunpi Israel mi pawl, nihin ni tiang Pathian hmai ah sia le ṭha fiahthiamnak famkim in ka nung,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Cule Puithiam Lubik Ananias nih Paul hramih a dingtu pawl sinah Paul cu a kaa ah beng uh, tiah thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mat 23.27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref></char></note> Cutikah Paul nih a sinah, “Nang sii rang hnuhmi phar — Pathian nih ta beng thok! Daan mangin thuṭhen dingah cuva ah na to, asinain ‘beng uh’ tih ih thu na pekmi nih cuvai Daan cu na buar!” tiah a sawn.<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Cule Paul hramih a ummi pawl nih Paul sinah, “Pathian ih Puithiam Lubik na hmuhsuam,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Cutikah Paul nih, “Ka phunpit Israel pawl, Puithiam Lubik a i tih cu ka fiah lo pi; zangahtihle Ca Thianghlim sungah, ‘Na miphun uktu relse hlah,’ tih in a um,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Forh 26.5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3.5</ref></char>
    </note> Cun Paul nih a hrekkhat cu Sadusi an i ih a hrekkhat cu Farasi an i tih a fiah tikah Khonsil upa hmai ah a hek ih, “Ka phunpit Israel mi pawl, kei hi Farasi fapa, Farasi rori ka i. A thi mi pawl an thosal thok tih ih ruahsatnak ka neih ruangah hiva ah tazacuai ka hmuak,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Cuti ih a sip hnukah, Farasi pawl le Sadusi pawl karlak ah thu alfaknak nasa ngai a suak, cule mipi pawl cu an ṭhen fa. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk 20.27</ref></char></note> Zangahtihle Sadusi pawl nih thawhsalnak a um lo, vancungmi khaw a um lo ih thlarau khaw a um lo, tiah an zum. Asinain Farasi pawl cu a pathum in an zum. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Cun an heh aw cu a thang deuhdeuh ih Farasi a i mi Daan Zirhtu hrekkhat pawl cu an ding ih ruahngai in an al ve. “Hivai pa sinah sualnak zangkhaw kan hmu lo, vancungmi lole thlarau nih a sinah thu a sim taktak a i men thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />O-alfaknak rauhngai in a suah tikah, Paul cu an thlekbauh colh pang thok tiah ralbawipi cu a thin a phang. Curuangah Paul cu mipi lakin la pit in ṭankulh ih fehpit dingin a ralkap pawl cu thu a pe.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Asinain a thang zan ah Bawipa cu Paul ih hramah a ding ih, “Paul, hnangamte in um! Jerusalem khawpi ih ka thu na phuansuah cem mangin, Rom khawpi khawah na phuangsuak tengteng thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul Thah An Tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Cule khua a van tikah, Judah mi lakin mi hrekkhat pawl cu an hmuakfa ih khua an khan. Paul an thah hlan lo zangkhaw ei le ding lo ih um dingin thu an kam fa. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Cuti ih khua a khangtu hi minung sawmli luan an i. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Puithiam upa pawl le upa dang pawl sinah an feh ih, “Kanma le kanma siatti dingin thu kan kam fa cem, Paul kan thah hlan sung cu zangkhaw kan ei thok lo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Curuangah nanma le Khonsil upa pawl nih Paul cu zingthlala ah kan sinah tianpit dingin, ralbawipi sinah ruahnak pe uhla, Paul ih thuhla kim deuh in fiah kan duh tiah tifater uh. Cule Paul a tian hlanah that dingin kan tiari fa cia thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Asinain Paul ih naunu ih fapa nih cuti ih an bawhthup thu a theih tikah, ralkap ṭankulh ah a lut ih Paul cu a va sim. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Cule Paul nih ralbawi pa pakhat a ko ih a sinah, “Hivai tlangval pa hi ralbawipi sinah hei ṭhi; thuruah ding pakhat a nei,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Cun ralbawipi sinah a hei ṭhi ih, “Thawngtla pa Paul nih ka na ko ih hivai tlangval pa hi na sinah fehpit dingin ka na forh, zangahtihle ani nih thu ta sip ding a nei,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Cule ralbawipi nih tlangval pa cu a kut in a ṭhita ih kawkennak ah, “Zangtu ka na sip duh?” tiah a sut.<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Cun ani nih, “Judah mi pawl nih zingthlala ah Paul cu Khonsil hmaiah suahpit dingin ta hler dingah an lung a kim cem. A thuhla famkim deuh in fiah kan duh tiah an tifater thok. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Asinain an thu cu ngai pang vai hlah; zangahtihle minung sawmli luan nih ani cu an bawhthup. Cuvai pawl cu Paul an thah hlan lo zangkhaw ding le ei lo dingin anma le anma thu an kam fa. Atun ah nangmai lungkimnak kau an hngah,” tiah a sim.<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Cule ralbawipi nih tlangval pa cu, “Ka sinih na sipmi pawl hi hutukhaw sim vai hlah,” tiah thu a pe ih a tlungter.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul cu Sisaria Khawpi ah An Thawn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Cule ralbawipi nih a kuttang ih ralbawi pa panih cu a ko hnei ih, “Sisaria khawpi ih feh dingah ralkap 200 in timtuah uh. Cun sai ralkap sawmsarih le thirfoi ralkap 200 khaw timtuah uh, zan nazi pakua ih poksuak dingin ralring seu. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Paul ih to dingah sai khaw timlam uhla Uktu Felix sinah himdamte in hei thlah uh,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Cule ralbawipi nih atangla mangin cakuat a ngan:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kei, Klaudius Lisias nih ram Uktu Upat tlak Felix na sinah ca ta kuat. Cibai ta ka buk. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Na sinih ta kuat mi pa hi Judah mi pawl nih an tlai ih thah an tum. Rom mi a i tih ka fiah ih ka ralkap pawl thawn kan runsuak. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Zangruangah sual an puh tih fiah duh ah Khonsil upa pawl sinah ka fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Thihnak tlak le thawngthlaknak tlak thu zangkhaw a um lo tih ka hmu. Sual an puh mi cu anma ih daan thuhla khi a i. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Cule ama thah duh ah khua an khan tih ka fiah ruangah na sinah ta kuat lohli. Sual a puhtu pawl khaw na hmai ah sual puh dingin ka sim hnei,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Cun ralbawipi ih thupeknak mangin ralkap pawl nih an tuah. Paul cu an ṭhita ih zan ah Antipatris khawpi tiang an feh. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />A zingthlala ah ke ralkap pawl cu an ṭankulh ah an kir ih sai ralkap pawl nih Paul cu an fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Sisaria khawpi an ban ih ram uktu pa sinah cakuat cu an pek hnukah Paul cu a kut sungah an ap. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ram uktu pa nih cakuat cu a siar ih, “Khoitu ram in na tiang?” tiah Paul cu a sut. Silisia ram in a tian tih a fiah tikah, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Paul sinah, “Sual ta puhtu pawl an tian tikah, na thuhla cu ka ngai leh thok,” tiah a ti. Cule Paul cu Herod ih sakmi siangpahrang inn ah ralkap nih kil dingin thu a pe.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Felix Hmai ah Paul Thuṭhennak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Cun ni nga hnukah Puithiam Lubik Ananias cu upa hrekkhat le sih-ni Tertullas thawn Sisaria khawpi ah an feh. Sih-ni pa nih ram uktu Felix hmai ah Paul sual an puhnak thu cu a sim. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Cule Paul cu an ko ih, sih-ni Tertullas nih Paul sual an puhnak thu cu Felix hmai ah hitih in sip a thok:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Nangmai uknak tangah can reingai daihnak kan ngah ih na zawnruahnak thawngin hi miphun sinah rep ṭulmi pawl na rem cem. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Upat tlak ngai mi Felix, hmunzakip ah le khawtik lai khawah lungawinak tamngai thawn ta cohlang ringring. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Reingai ta hnaihnok lonak dingah thinfahte in ka ṭonkam temte ka na ngaisak dingah ta dil. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Zangahtihle hivai pa hi mi buaitertu a i tiah kan hmu. Leilung pumpuluk ih Judah miphun pawl hmahhmah a buaiter reuhro ih Nazareth bu hruaitu a i. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Cule Biakinn borhhlawhter a tum ih kan tlai. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" pubnumber="[7]" sid="ACT 24:7" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.6–8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 6b–8a: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Cule kan daan mangin a thu rel kan tum, </char><char style="fv">7</char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">asinain ralbawipi Lisias a tiang ih hramhram in kan na long. </char><char style="fv">8</char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">Cu hnukah Lisias nih Paul tazacuai a duhtu pawl cu na sinah hin feh seu tiah thu a pek, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Nangma nih hivai pa hi na zingzoi a sih ahcun sual kan puhmi pawl hi na hmufiang thok,” tiah an ti. <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Cun Judah mi pawl nih an bawm ih a sipmi pawl hi a dikmi an i, tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Felix Hmai ah Paul ih Humfaknak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Cun ram uktu pa nih Paul cu thu sim ve dingah a kut in a zap ih Paul nih a sinah,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Nang cu kum tamngai sung hi vai miphun thuṭhentu na i tih ka fiah ih atun na hmai ah humfaknak can ka ngah ruangah ka lung a awi setak. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Jerusalem ah Pathian be dingih ka fehnak hi ni hleinih nakin a tam rih lo tih cu na fiah kau. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Cule Biakinn sungah hutu thawn khaw thu kan al fa lo ih Sinakok ah le khawpi sung khoitu hmun khawah mi ka tokhrolh lo, tih cu Judah mi pawl nih an fiah colh kau. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Cun atun ah na hmai ih sual ka na puh hnei mi pawl hi a dik taktak tiah ta hmuh eng thei thok lo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ka tuah taktak tiah na hmai ih ka sip duhmi cu hihi a si: Kan pupa pawl ih Pathian ka biaknak ah Zalam kan tihmi ka thlun; anni nih cuvai Zalam cu a dik lo tiah an ti. Asinain Moses Daan sungih nganmi hmahhmah le profet pawl ih nganmi cabu sung ummi hmahhmah khaw ka zum colh. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Anni mangin kei khaw Pathian sinah ruahsatnak ka nei ve. Cuih ruahsatnak cu miṭha khaw iseh, miṭha lo khaw iseh, mi hmahhmah cu thihnak in an thosal thok, tihmi hi a si. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Curuangah Pathian hmai le minung hmai ah sia le ṭha fiahthiamnak nei dingin ka zuam reuhro.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.17,18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Forh 21.17–28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Kum reingai sung Jerusalem khawpi ih ka um i lo hnukah, ka miphun pawl bopnak tangka pe ding le thawinak pe dingin Jerusalem khawpi ah ka feh. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Daan mangin thianfai faknak ka tuah colh hnukah a tlun ih ka sipmi pawl ka tuah vekvo lai ah, Biakinn sungah ka na hmu eng. Culai ah ka sinah mipi an um lo ih buainak khaw a um lo. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Asinain cuvai hmun ah Asia ram ih a tiangmi Judah mi hrekkhat an um. Cuvai pawl cu ka cungah lungkim lonak an neih a si ahcun na hmai ah anma rori nih sual ka puh seu. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Asihlole hiva ih a ummi Khonsil upa pawl hmai ih ka din lai ah ka tuahsualmi an hmuh asihle ta sim seu. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Forh 23.6</ref></char></note> An hmai ih ka din lai ah thil pakhat kau ka sipmi a um: ‘Mithi pawl cu an thosal thok,’ tih ih ka zup ruangah nihinni ah tazacuai in ka um,” tiah a sim.<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Cule Felix cu cuvai Zalam thuhla ṭhangai in a fiah ruangah an thurel cu a cawlhngater hnei ih, “Ralbawipi Klaudius Lisias a tian tikah nan thu cu ka rel leh thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Paul kiltu ralbawi sinah, “Paul cu ṭhangai in kil uh, cule zalennak temte tal pe uh la a rualpi nih a ṭulhaimi pawl tawlrelsak seu,” tiah thu a pe.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Felix le Drusilla Hmai ah Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ni tawkfang a reih hnukah, Felix cu a nupi Drusilla thawn an tiang. Drusilla cu Judah mi a i. Paul cu a ko ih, Paul ih Jesuh Khrih zupnak thuhla a sip mi cu a ngai. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Asinain Paul nih dingfelnak thu, ma le ma supfaktheinak thu le a tianglai dingmi Thuṭhennak Ni thu pawl a sip tikah Felix nih a ṭih ih, “Atun cu tawkrih seh! Na tlung thei. Tikcu remcang ka neih tikah ta ko leh thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Cuvai can ah Paul nih tangka ka pe sehla tiah Felix nih ruahsatnak a nei. Curuangah Paul cu a ko ṭiṭia ih a be leplo.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Kum nih a reih hnukah, Porsius Festas nih Felix ih ai a awh. Asinain Felix cu Judah mi pawl lungawiter a duh ruangah Paul cu thawnginn sungah a ramta.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Festas Hmai ah Paul Tazacuainak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Festas cu cuvai ram a batnak ni thum hnukah, Sisaria khawpi in Jerusalem khawpi ah a feh. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Cuva ah Puithiam upa pawl le Judah mi hruaitu pawl nih Paul sual an puhmi cu a sinah an sim. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Paul cu lampi lakih thah an duh ruangah Jerusalem khawpi ah thlah dingin thinfah an dil. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Festas nih, “Paul cu Sisaria khawpi ih thawngtla a i ih keima khaw Sisaria khawpi ah ka kir tawn thok. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Curuangah nan hruaitu pawl cu ka thlun dah seu la hivai pa nih sualnak a neih a sih ahcun sual puh seu,” tiah a let hnei.<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festas cu an sinah ni riat a ih lole ni hra nakih tam a cam hnukah Sisaria ah a tlung. A zingthlala ah thuṭhennak tokheng ah a to ih, Paul cu ko dingin thu a pe. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paul cu thuṭhennak zung ih a tian tikah, Jerusalem khawpi in a tiangmi Judah mi pawl cu a kimvel ah an ding ih, rauh ngai in sual an puh; asinain sual an puhmi cu a dik rori tiah an langter thei lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paul cu ama le ma a humfa ih, “Judah daan dokalh in iseh, Biakinn dokalh in iseh, Caesar dokalh in iseh zangkhaw thilsual ka tuah lo,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Asinain Festas cu Judah mi pawl lungawiter a duh ruangah, Paul cu a sawn ih, “Jerusalem ah feh in cuva ah ka hmai ah taza ta cuai seu la na lungkim im?” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Cule Paul nih a sawn ih, “Caesar ih thuṭhennak zung hmai ah atun hi ka ding, hivai hmunah taza ka cuai seu. Fiangngai ih na fiah mangin Judah mi pawl sinah thilsual zangkhaw ka tuah lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Thihnak tlak thilsual tuah hnik ningla cu thih hi ka el lo. Asinain anni ih sual ka na puh eng mi hi pakhat khaw a dik lo a sih ahcun, hutu khaw nih an kut ah ka na pe eng thei thok lo. Caesar sinah a zu ka khan,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Cun Festas cu a khonsil upa pawl thawn thu an ronfak hnukah Paul cu, “Caesar sinah a zu na khan mangin Caesar sin na feh thok,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih Agrippa le Bernis sinah Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ni tawkfang hnukah Siangpahrang Agrippa le a nupi Bernis cu Festas cibai buk dingah Sisaria khawpi ah an tiang. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Cuva ah ni rei nawn an cam hnukah, Festas nih Paul ih thuhla cu siangpahrang Agrippa sinah hitihin a sim, “Felix ih thawngthlak tak mi pa hiva ah a um. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Jerusalem khawpi ih na feh lai ah Judah upa pawl le puithiam upa pawl nih sual an puh ih a thu ṭhen dingah ka na hler eng. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Cule kei nih an sinah, ‘Sual an puh mi pa cu sual a puhtu pawl hmai ah ama le ma humfaknak can a neih hlanah an kut ih ap cu Rom mi pawl ih nunphung a i lo,’ tiah ka ti hnei. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Curuangah ka sinih an tian tikah, tikcu tlaiter loin a zingthlala ah thuṭhennak tokheng ah ka to ih Paul cu ko dingin thu ka pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Sual a puhtu pawl cu an ding ih thu an sip tikah, ka ruah mang tlukin sualpuh theimi an nei lo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Cunakin an biaknak thuhla le Jesuh an tihmi pa cu a thi ih a nung sal tiah Paul ih a sipmi thu sawn ah alfaknak an nei. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Cule cuvai an alfaknak pawl cu zangtih ih zingzoi ding ka fiah lo ruangah, Jerusalem khawpi ah feh in cuva ah sual ta puhmi pawl hi thuṭhen sak i la na lungkim nam, tiah Paul cu ka sut. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Asinain Paul nih a zu a khan ih a thuhla cu Caesar nih relsak dingah ka na hler. Curuangah Caesar sinih ka kuat hlan sung cu ralkap pawl nih kil dingin thu ka pe,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Cutikah Agrippa nih Festas sinah, “Cuvai pa ih thusipmi cu keima rori nih theih ka duh,” tiah a ti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festas nih, “Zingthlala ah na thei thok,” tiah a let.<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Cun a zingthlala ah Agrippa le a nupi Bernis cu an tiang, hmuahkhawm faknak khan sungah sunglawi ngai in an lut ih ralbawipi pawl le khaw sung upa nih an thlun. Cule Festas ih thupeknak mangin Paul cu an tianpit. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Cun Festas nih, “Siangpahrang Agrippa le kan sinih a um mi hmahhmah nih hivai pa hi nan hmu. Jerusalem khawpi ah iseh, hiva Sisaria khawpi ah iseh, Judah mi hmahhmah nih a thuhla ka sinah an tianpit ih hivai pa cu nung ding tlak a i i lo tiah an hek. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Asinain thihnak tlak zangkhaw a tuah lo tih ka hmu, cule ama rori nih Caesar sinah a zu a khan ruangah a sinih kuat dingin thu ka ṭhencat cem. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Asinain bawipa Caesar sinah hivai pa ih thuhla ngan ding zangkhaw ka fiah cuca lo. Curuangah a thuhla ka zingzoi thokih ngan ding zangmawtal ka neih pangah tiah, nan zate hmai le Siangpahrang Agrippa na hmai rori ah ka suahpit. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Zangahtihle thawngtla pakhat dokalh in sual an puh mi cu a thu felfai ngai fiangter lo in Rom ih kuat ding cu a mawi deuh lo tiah ka ruat,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Agrippa Hmai ah Paul nih Humfaknak Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Cun Agrippa nih Paul sinah, “Nangma na hrangah na thuhla sip ding cu ta sian,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Paul cu a ban a han pharh ih a humfaknak thu a sim.<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Siangpahrang Agrippa, nihin sun na hmai ah Judah mi pawl ih sual ka na puhnak pawl lakin humfaknak thu sip can ka ngah ruangah mi vanṭha ka i tiah ka ruat fa. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Nang cu Judah mi pawl ih nunphung hmahhmah le an alfaknak pawl hmahhmah khaw a fiah ngai tu na sih ruangah ka vanṭha hlehhlo tiah ka ruat. Curuangah thinsaute in ka ngaisak hram tiah thinfah ta dil.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Ka nappan lai ih ka nuntu khawsak dan iseh, ka miphun pawl lakih ka nuntu khawsak dan le Jerusalem khawpi ih ka nuntu khawsak dan pawl cu a thoktir in Judah mi pawl hmahhmah nih an fiah colh. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Forh 23.6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3.5</ref></char></note>Hlan lai ne in ka na fiah eng tuk cem, an duh a sih ahcun, kan biaknak ih a khoh bikmi bu Farasi pakhat mangin ka nung, tihmi khaw an sim thei thok. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Cule nihin sun hiva ah taza ka na cuai eng khaw hi kan pupa pawl sinah Pathian nih thu a tiam mi ruahsatnak ka neih ruangah a si. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Cuvai thutiam cu kan phunhnam hleinih pawl nih a sun a zan taima ngai in Pathian an biaknak in famkim dingah an ruahsat mi a i. Maw Siangpahrang Agrippa, cuvai ruahsatnak ruangah Judah mi pawl nih taza ka na cuai eng mi a i. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Pathian nih mithi a thoter tih cu zangruangah a cangtheilo tiah nan ruat?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.9–11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Forh 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref></char>
    </note>“Nazareth mi Jesuh ih hmin dokalh in thil hmahhmah ka tuah thok, tiah ka ruat ta dah. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Cuvai cu Jerusalem khawpi ih ka tuah tak dahmi a i. Puithiam upa pawl sinin thuneihnak ka ngah ih Pathian ih mithiang pawl tamngai thawng ah ka thla hnei. Thah dingih thu relsak an ih tikah ka lungkimpit hnei. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Vei tamngai sinakok cangcang ah cawhkuan ka pe hnei, lo theih loin Pathian thangsiatter hnei ka tum. An cungah ka thin a se tuk ih anni hrem dingah ramdang khawpi pawl tiang ka feh.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih A Lungthlennak Thu A Sim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Forhthlah 9.1–19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Cutih in puithiam upa pawl ih thuneihnak le thupeknak thawn Damaskas khua ah ka feh. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Maw siangpahrang Agrippa, sun lai fang lampi ih ka feh vekvo lai ah, ni nakih a tle sawn mi meisa tle nih keima le ka fehpit mi pawl kimvel ah van in a ron tlet cu ka hmu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kan zatein leilung ah kan ok colh ih Hebru ṭon in aw pakhat ka thei ih ka sinah, ‘Saul, Saul, zangruangah ka na hrem ngelngo? Fungzum sirh cu na hrangah a har,’ tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Cutikah kei nih, ‘Bawipa, hutu na si?’ tiah ka sut. Cule ani nih, ‘Na hrem ngelngo mi Jesuh ka si. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Hang tho la na ke in ding. Ka na riantu dingah le na hmuh cia mi pawl le ta hmuh lai dingmi pawl fiahpittu dingah ta hril cem, cuvai tumtahnak thawn na sinah ka lang mi a i. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nang cu Israel mi pawl le Zentail mi pawl sinah ta thlah thok ih, an kut sungin ta rung thok. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />An mit vangter dingah le khawmaw sungin khawvang ah, Seihtan ih huham cahnak sungin Pathian sinih kir ter dingah a i. Cutih ih ka na zupnak thawngin an sualnak pawl ngaihthiam an i thok ih Pathian ih thianhlimter mi pawl lakah an tel ve thok,’ tiah ka na ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul nih A Ṭuanṭuannak A Sim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Curuangah siangpahrang Agrippa, van la in langnak ka hmuhmi cu ka el thei lo. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Forh 9.20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref></char></note>Hmasabik ah Damaskas khawpi ah, cun Jerusalem khawpi ah, cule Judea peng sung hmahhmah le Zentail mi pawl sinah ka feh ih, an sual sir in Pathian sin kir dingah le sualsirnak thawn a mil fa mi ṭuan ṭuan dingin thu ka sim hnei. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Hivai thu pawl ruangah Judah mi pawl nih Biakinn sungih ka um lai ah ka na tlai eng ih thah ka na tum. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Asinain nihin ni tiang Pathian nih ka na bawm ih atun na hmai ah ka ding, ka hmuhmi thu cu mi picang le mi tenau nan a zate hmai ah ka sim. Ka sipmi thu hi Moses le profet pawl nih a cang leh thok tih ih an sip cia mi an i. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Kor 15.20</ref></char></note>Cutih ih an sipmi cu: Khrih cu a tuar thok ih, ani cu mithi lak in tho hmasabik a i thok; Judah mi pawl le Zentail pawl sinah tleunak thu a phuang thok, tih hi a i,” tiah Paul nih a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paul nih cutih ih a humfaknak thu a rel lai ah, Festas cu tha ngai in a hek ih, “Paul, na aa i sang! Na zir tamtuknak nih ta aa ter i hmahsin!” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Asinain Paul nih, “Upat tlak Festas, ka aa lo sangkhaw! Ka sipmi hi thutak le ruahtlak an i. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Zangahtihle hih thu pawl hi siangpahrang pa nih a fiah colh ih a sinah zalen ngai in ka sim. Hivai thil pawl hmahhmah hi a thupte ih tuahmi an ih lo ruangah siangpahrang pa nih a fiah colh tih ka fiang. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Siangpahrang Agrippa, profet pawl cu zum cim? Na zum tih ka fiah,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Cun Agrippa nih Paul sinah, “Hivai tikcu tawite sungah Khristian cang kau ka na lem na tum maw?” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Cule Paul nih, “Tikcu a tawi ah iseh, a sau ah iseh, nang ma kau i lo in nihin sun hiva ah ka thu a ngaitu nan zatein, hivai ka kut ih khihmi thirhri pawl hrello, kei mang i colh ula, tih hi Pathian sinah ka thlacamnak a i,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Siangpahrang, a nupi Bernis, ram uktu le an sinih a totu pawl cu an ding ih, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />an feh hnukah pakhat le pakhat, “Hivai pa hi thihnak tlak le thawngthlaknak tlak zangkhaw a tuah lo,” tiah an ti fa. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Cun Agrippa nih Festas sinah, “Ama nih Caesar sinah a zu khan hlah sehla cu kan luatter thei thok nan bolh,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Rom ah Paul A Feh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Cun Italy ram ah lawng thawn kan feh thok, tiah thu an ṭhencat tikah, Paul le thawngtla dang pawl cu “Caesar Ralkap Burpi” hohatu ralbawi Julius tihmi ralbawipi ih kut ah an pe. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Cule Adaramittium khawpi in a tiang mi, Asia ram lawng cawlhngatnak cangcang ih a cawlhnga pah dingmi lawng cu kan to ih kan feh. Masidonia ram Thesalonika khawmi Aristarkas khaw kan sinah a tel ve. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />A zingthlala ah Sidon khawpi kan ban. Cule Julius nih Paul cu a thinfak ih a ṭulhai mi pawl an pek theinak dingah a rualpi pawl sinih feh khaw a sian. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Cuvai hmun in kan pok sal ih zil cu kan la hlang ih a zuan ruangah Saipras tikulh zil zuan lonak la in kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Cun Silisia ram le Pamfilia ram hram ih tifingriat tan in kan feh ih Lisia ram Mira khawpi ah kan ban. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Cuva ah ralbawi pa nih Alexandria in a tiang ih Italy ram a feh dingmi lawng a hmu ih, cuvai lawng cu kan na to ter.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Nuamtete in ni tamngai sung kan feh hnukah, harsa ngai in Snidas khawpi zawn kan ban. Cuva la in feh bet ding cu zil nih kan na kham ruangah Salmon ram khatla ral Krete tikulh zil zuan lonak la in kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Harsa ngai in kan feh ih Lasia khawpi hram ih “Himnak Lawng Cawlhngatnak” tihmi hmun pawl ah kan ban.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Tikcu tamngai a liam cem ih Sualtlatnak Ni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sualtlatnak Ni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hivai hi September thla ne, a ihlole, October thla thar hrawngih an tuahmi puai a i. Cuvai can cu zil tam laifang a ih ruangah lawng thawn khualtlot cu ṭihkhai a i.</char></note> a luan cem ruangah lawng thawn khualtlot cu ṭih a nung i. Curuangah Paul nih an sinah ralrinnak a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />Paul nih an sinah, “U le nau pawl, kan khualtlotnak cu ṭihkhaiza a i tiah ka hmu. Nan phurhmi thilri pawl le lawng hi rauhngai a siat thok ih kan nunnak khaw a riaral thok,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Asinain ralbawi pa nih Paul ih thusipmi nakin lawng mawngtu bawi le lawng neitu pawl ih thu a ngai sawn. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Cuvai an lawng cawlhngatnak cu isik can ah cawlhngat a ṭhat lo ruangah mi tam sawn nih feh pehzom ding an duh. Finiks khawpi tian ding le cuva ah isik sung um ding an ruahsan. Finiks cu Krete tikulh ih lawng cawlhngatnak hmun a i ih ni tlaknak thlangla le ni tlaknak sakla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ni tlaknak thlangla le ni tlaknak sakla; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">loleh </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ni suahnak thlangla le ni suahnak sakla.</char></note> tut in a um.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zilpi A Zuang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Thlangla in zil nemte cu a zuang ih an saduhthah mangin feh thei dingah an ruat. Curuangah lawng an dinternak cu an phoih ih Krete tikulh kapin an feh. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Asinain a rei hlanah, “Nisuah Sakla ih Zilpi” an tihmi cu Krete tikulh la in rauhngai in a zuang. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Zilpi nih kan lawng cu a pah ih kan lawng cu hmala a nor thei i lo. Curuangah kan lawng cu kan thlah ih zil nih a duhnak nak ah kan na fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Cun Kauda tihmi tikulh fate zil zuan lonak la in kan feh lai ah harsa ngai in vokkuang lawng cu kan tuah thei. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Cule vokkuang lawng cu lawng cungah an duk ih lawng kimvel ah hri thawn khoh ngai in an khit. Sirtis vutnel pawl a rawt pah ding an phan ruangah lawng puanzar cu an ṭhum. Cule zil nih a duhnak nak ah kan na fehpit. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Cule zilpi nih rauhngai in kan na thawi ih a zingthlala ah lawng ih phurhmi thilri pawl cu ti sungah an hlon. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />A tipsun ah kan kut rori in lawng thilri pawl cu kan hlon. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ni tamngai sung ni le arsi pawl an lang lo ih zilpi cu rauhngai in a zuang. Netabik ah kan nung thok tih ih kan ruahsatnak hmahhmah an lo colh.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Lawng cungih minung pawl cu caw ei lo in ni tamngai an um hnukah Paul cu an hmai ah a ding ih, “U le nau pawl, ka thu ka ngai pit in Krete tikulh la in feh usingla, hiti mang siatralnak le lawhralhnak kan hmuak thok lo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Asinain atun ah hnangamte in um dingah nan ta forh, zangahtihle hutu ih nunnak khaw a loral thok lo; kan lawng belte cu a siat thok. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Zangahtihle ka na neitu le ka biak mi Pathian ih vancungmi cu nizan ah ka hramah a ding ih ka sinah, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />‘Paul, ṭih vai hlah. Caesar ih hmai ah na ding tengteng thok ih, nang thawn lawng a totu hmahhmah ih nunnak cu Pathian nih na sinah ta pe cem,’ tiah ka na ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Curuangah u le nau pawl, hnangamte in um uh, zangahtihle Pathian ka zum ih ka na sipcia mangin a cang tengteng thok. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Asinain zil nih tikulh pakhat khat ih tikap leilung ah tang kau kan na zuanpit thok,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Zan hleilitnak ah, Adriatic tifingriat ah cun zil nih kan na thawi nianno. Zanruang hrawngah lawng mawngtu pawl cu tikap leilung kan naih i tiah an ruat. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Cule ti a thuk le thuk lo an tah ih pi za le kul a thuk tih an hmu. Temte a reih hnukah an tah sal ih pi sawmkua a thuk tih an hmu. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Cun lung an pah pang ding an phan ruangah lawng mei la in thirkawn pali an ron ṭhil ih khua vang dingin thla an cam. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Cule lawng mawngtu pawl cu zuan an tum ih vokkuang lawng pawl cu ti sungah an ron ṭhum, cule lawng hmala in thirkawn pawl ṭhil ding mangin an umfater. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Cun Paul nih ralbawi pa le ralkap pawl sinah, “Lawng mawngtu pawl lawng sungih an um lo asihle, nan luat thei thok lo,” tiah a ti hnei. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Curuangah ralkap pawl nih vokkuang lawng khihnak hri pawl cu cat in an sat ih vokkuang lawng pawl cu ti an phuanter.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Cule khua a van hlante ah an zatein caw ei dingah Paul nih a forh hnei. Paul nih, “Ticaw zangkhaw ding ei lo in nan hngahnak ni hleilitnak a i cem. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Curuangah caw ei dingin nan ta forh. Nan nunnak dingah caw nan ei a ṭul. Nan lu cungih nan sam fang khat hman a lo thok lo,” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Cuvai thu pawl a sip colh hnukah, sang temte a la ih an zate hmai ah Pathian sin lungawithu a sim, cule a seu ih an ei. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Midang khaw an hna a ngam ih caw an ei ve. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Lawng sungih a um hmahhmah cu minung 276<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">276; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">275; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um; a dang pawl sungah cu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">76 hrawng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah a um.</char></note> kan i. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />An duh zat vek an ei colh hnukah, lawng zangter dingah sangvut pawl cu tifingriat sungah an hlon.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lawng A Siat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Khua a hang van i tikah, khoitu ram a i tih an fiah lo. Asinain tikap leilung an hmu ih, a canthiam ahcun, cuva ah an lawng cawlhngatter an tum. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Cule thirkawn pawl cu cat in an sat ih tifingriat sungah an pilter. Cun hri thawn an khih mi lawng hlauhnak cu an phoih. Cule lawng hmala ih puanzar cu zil nih sem dingin an zar ih tili kap la an feh. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Asinain tifingriat panih hmuahfaknak hmun kan ban ih lawng nih lei a sawh, cule lawng hmala cu vutnel ah a dawt fa ih thawn theih loin a tang. Tisuar nih lawng mei cu a parh ter colh.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ralkap pawl nih, thawngtla pawl cu ti hlau pit in an zuang pang thok, tih an phan ruangah, thah an duh. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Asinain ralbawi pa nih, Paul cu a hum duh ruangah a kham hnei. Cule ti hlauh thiam pawl cu lawng sungin dawp dingah le tikap la ah hlau dingin thu a pe hnei. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />A tangmi pawl nih thingtlep maw, lawng a siatmi thil maw, an awh ih an thlun. Cutih in kan zatein tikap ah himdamte in kan ban.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Malta Tikulh ah Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Cun himdamte in tikap kan tian tikah cuvai tikulh cu Malta tikulh a i tih kan fiah. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Cuvai tikulh ih om minung pawl cu kan cungah an ṭha ngai. Zuah a zu ih i a sik tuk ruangah kan hrangah meipawl kan na tih sak ih ṭha ngai in kan na cohlang eng. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paul nih thing a khawlkhawm ih meipawl ah a paih. Meisa a sat ruangah thing sungin rul a hang suak ih Paul ih kut ah a cu. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Paul kut ih rul thlaifa cu tikulh om minung pawl nih an hmuh tikah, pakhat le pakhat, “Hivai pa hi laithat a i tengteng, tifingriat sungin himdamte in a suak kau nain diknak khawzing nih nun a sian lo si lai tu!” tiah an ti fa. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Asinain Paul nih rul cu meisa sungah ṭil in a thing ih ama cu a zangkhaw a poih lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Cuvai tikulh ih om minung pawl nih, a thling thok ih hmakhatte ah ok pit in a thi thok, tiah an ruat. Asinain reingai an zoh ih a cungah zangkhaw a cang lo tih an hmuh tikah, an thinlung an thleng ih, “Hivai pa hi pathian a i thok,” tiah an ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Cuvai hmun kiangkap ah, tikap upa Publias tihmi pa nih lo a nei. Publias nih a inn ah kan na cohlang ih ni thum sung ṭha ngai in kan na zohkhen. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Cuvai can ah Publias ih pa cu isik le santen in a fak ih a it. Paul cu a sinah a lut ih a cungah a kut suang in thla a camsak ih a dam. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Cutih ih a tuah ruangah cuvai tikulh ih a um mi mifak hmahhmah cu Paul sinah an tiang ih damnak an ngah colh. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Upatnak ah laksawng tamngai kan na pe ih lawng thawn kan feh tum fangah kan ṭul mi din ei ding pawl lawng tlunah kan na siah sak.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malta in Rom Khawpi ah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Thla thum hnukah Alexandria khawpi in a tiangmi, Castor le Pollux faphir pathian pawl zuk thawn hminhlihnak a ummi lawng cu kan to. Cuvai lawng cu isik sung hmahhmah cuvai tikulh ah a ummi a i. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Cule Sirakus khawpi ah kan ban ih cuva ah ni thum kan cam. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Cuva in kan suak sal ih Rezium an tihmi khawpi kan ban. Ni khat hnukah thlangla in zil a hang zuang ih a ni nih nak ah Puteoli khawpi kan ban. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Cuva ah zumtu unau pawl an um ih an sinah ni sarih sung cam dingin kan na sawm. Cule Rom khawpi la ah kan feh. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Rom khawpi ih zumtu unau pawl nih kan tian an fiah tikah Appius Dawr an tihmi khua le Riahbuk Pathum an tihmi khua tiang kan na bawh eng. Paul nih a hmuh hnei tikah, Pathian sinah a lung a awi ih a hna a ngam.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rom Khawpi ah Paul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Rom khawpi kan tian tikah Paul cu amate in an umter ih ralkap pakhat an kilter.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Cule hitih in a si, ni thum hnukah Paul nih Judah mi pawl lakih an hruaitu pawl a kokhawm. An tian tikah Paul nih an sinah, “Ka phunpit Israel mi pawl, kan miphun le kan pupa pawl ih nunphung kalhzawng in zangkhaw ka tuah lo, cu cingin Judah mi pawl nih Jerusalem ah thawng ka na thla ih Rom mi pawl kut ah ka na ap. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Rom mi pawl nih ka na cekfel ih ka na thlah an duh, zangahtihle thihnak tlak sual ka tuah lo tih an hmu. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Forh 25.11</ref></char></note> Asinain Judah mi pawl nih an el, curuangah Caesar sinah lo theih loin a zu ka khan. Ka miphun pawl dokalhnak zangkhaw ka nei lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Curuangah nan ta hmuh ding le nan sinah thusim ding ih ka hlerhnak san a i. Thirhri thawn ih ka na khih eng nak san cu Israel mi pawl ih ruahsatnak ruangah a si,” tiah a ti.<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Cun Judah hruaitu pawl nih Paul sinah, “Na thuhla thawn pehpar in Judea ram in cakuat zangkhaw kan ngah lo. Cule na thuhla a sia a ṭha simtu dingah acuvai ram la in a tiangmi kan milai hukhaw an um lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Asinain na ruahdan cu theih kan duh, zangahtihle hmunzakip ah nan bu dokalh in an rel, tih kan fiah,” tiah an let.<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Cule Paul thawn hmuak fa dingah ni an khiah fa ih a riahnak hmun ah mi tamngai nih an pha. Mawla in zanla tiang Pathian Uknak thu cu an sinah a sim ih, Moses Daan cabu sung le profet pawl ih cazual sungin Jesuh ih thuhla cu an lung lut dingin a simfiang hnei. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Cule a sipmi thu cu mihrek khat nih an fiang ih, mi hrekkhat nih cu an zum lo. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Cun Paul ih netabik thu pakhat a sipmi ruangah pakhat le pakhat an lung a rual lo ih an ṭhenṭhek fa. Cuvai a sipmi cu, “Thlarau Thianghlim nih kan pupa pawl sinah profet Isaiah hmangin thu dik ngai a sim. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Profet Isaiah ih a sipmi cu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“ ‘Hivai minung pawl sinah va feh la va sim hnei;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Nan ngai ngelngo thok nain nan cingthiam thok lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Nan zoh ngelngo thok nain nan hmu thok lo.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Zangahtihle hivai minung pawl ih thinlung cu a pit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an naa a set ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an mit an cawce.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Cutih in i hlah sehla an mit in an hmu thok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an naa in an thei thok ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">an thinlung in an cingthiam thok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Cule ka sinah an kirsal thok ih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ka damter hnei thok,’ tih hi a si.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />“Curuangah Pathian ih rundamnak cu Zentail mi pawl sinah pek a i cem, tih hi nan fiah a ṭul. Anni nih cuvai thu cu an ngai thok!” tiah a ti. <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" pubnumber="[29]" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A hrekkhat kutngan cabu pawl sungah cu afate 29: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Paul nih cuvai thu a sip colh hnukah, Judah mi pawl cu an ṭin ih anma le anma rauhngai in an el fa, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiah an be.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Cun Paul cu amate in a sawnmi inn ah kum nih sung a um ih ama hmu dingin a sinih a tiangmi pawl hmahhmah cu a cohlang hnei. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Ralṭha ngai le zalen ngai in Pathian Uknak thu cu a sim ih Bawi Jesuh Khrih ih thu khaw a zirh.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>